  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is C, B, D, A. Push A, B and C, pop C, pop B, then push D and pop it, and finally pop A. The other sequences are impossible because a stack is last-in first-out; for example, in A, D, B, C once D has been output B and C must still be on the stack with C on top, so B cannot come out before C.',
