  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is Ajax (Asynchronous JavaScript and XML). It uses JavaScript to exchange data with the server asynchronously in the background and update only part of the page, so the screen changes without a full page transition. CSS handles styling, RSS is a feed format, and SNS refers to social networking services.',
