  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is creating vector graphics made of mathematically defined lines and curves that can be transformed or combined. Drawing software works with vector shapes, so figures can be resized without loss of quality. Choice a describes paint software that produces bitmap images, choice b describes authoring software, and choice c describes morphing.',
