  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"","image":"2021-april-a-q45-choice-a.webp"},{"label":"b","text":"","image":"2021-april-a-q45-choice-b.webp"},{"label":"c","text":"","image":"2021-april-a-q45-choice-c.webp"},{"label":"d","text":"","image":"2021-april-a-q45-choice-d.webp"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the diagram in which Sports car connects to Automobile with a hollow triangle arrowhead. In UML this arrow means generalization: a sports car is a kind of automobile and inherits its features. The plain line with multiplicities is an association, the dashed arrow is a dependency, and the filled diamonds show composition.',
