  'A',
  54,
  'Q54. In system development, when the relationship between person-months and the duration (months) is represented in the approximate expression shown below, and the total person-month is 4096, how many months does it take?

Duration = 2.5 × person-months^(1/3)',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q54. In system development, when the relationship between person-months and the duration (months) is represented in the approximate expression shown below, and the total person-month is 4096, how many months does it take?\n\nDuration = 2.5 × person-months^(1/3)"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"16"},{"label":"b","text":"40"},{"label":"c","text":"64"},{"label":"d","text":"160"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is 40 months. The cube root of 4096 is 16 because 16³ = 4096, so the duration is 2.5 × 16 = 40 months. Choice 16 is just the cube root, before multiplying by 2.5.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'project-management'),
  'medium',
