  'A',
  71,
  'Q71. The figure below shows the relationships among the components of product A, and the numbers in parentheses indicate the quantity of components necessary to produce one unit of the upper-level product or component. When 10 units of product A are produced, how many units of component C must be ordered? Here, there are presently five units of component C in the inventory.',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q71. The figure below shows the relationships among the components of product A, and the numbers in parentheses indicate the quantity of components necessary to produce one unit of the upper-level product or component. When 10 units of product A are produced, how many units of component C must be ordered? Here, there are presently five units of component C in the inventory."}]'::jsonb,
