  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is 25 units. Each unit of A needs one C directly plus two B, each containing one C, so 3 C per A, or 30 C for 10 units of A. Subtracting the 5 units already in inventory leaves 30 − 5 = 25 to order.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
