(
  '2021-october',
  'A',
  67,
  'Q67. The sales prices of products are decided according to different sales price setting methods.
 Which of the following approaches sets a high sales price by using the consumer psychology
 that high quality equals to high price?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,392.93,533.23,459.13],"text":"Q67.\nThe sales prices of products are decided according to different sales price setting methods.\nWhich of the following approaches sets a high sales price by using the consumer psychology\nthat high quality equals to high price?"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,464.93,429.45,514.21],"text":"a) Cost plus pricing\nb) Differential pricing\nc) Marketing price following pricing\nd) Prestige pricing"},{"type":"code","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,808.39],"text":"– 25 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Cost plus pricing"},{"label":"b","text":"Differential pricing"},{"label":"c","text":"Marketing price following pricing"},{"label":"d","text":"Prestige pricing"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The approach is prestige pricing, which sets a deliberately high price because consumers tend to associate a high price with high quality and status. Cost plus pricing adds a margin to cost, and differential pricing charges different prices to different segments or times.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2021A, FE, Subject-A, Q67)',
  ARRAY[25]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q67. The sales prices of products are decided according to different sales price setting methods.
 Which of the following approaches sets a high sales price by using the consumer psychology
 that high quality equals to high price?

 a) Cost plus pricing b) Differential pricing
 c) Marketing price following pricing d) Prestige pricing',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2021-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[25]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2021-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
