  '[{"label":"a","text":"LMS"},{"label":"b","text":"OMS"},{"label":"c","text":"TMS"},{"label":"d","text":"WMS"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The system is a TMS (Transportation Management System), which plans and analyses delivery routes, tracks shipments and examines load tendencies to optimize transportation. A WMS manages operations inside a warehouse, an OMS manages customer orders, and an LMS is typically a learning management system.',
