 b) Conditions 8x + 6y ≥ 60, 10x + 3y ≤ 40, x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0
 Objective function 2000x + 800y  minimize
 c) Conditions 8x + 10y ≤ 60, 6x + 3y ≤ 40, x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0
 Objective function 2000x + 800y  minimize
 d) Conditions 8x + 10y ≥ 60, 6x + 3y ≤ 40, x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0
 Objective function 2000x + 800y  minimize',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2021-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[30]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2021-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
