  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q1. For logical variables A and B, which of the following is equivalent to the NOR operation on A and B? Here, A + B, A ∙ B, and A̅ are OR, AND, and NOT operations on the corresponding variables, respectively."}]'::jsonb,
