  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct order is A, D, B, C. Effective access time with a cache is hit rate × cache time + (1 − hit rate) × main memory time. C gives 0.6 × 20 + 0.4 × 70 = 40 ns and D gives 0.9 × 10 + 0.1 × 80 = 17 ns, while A and B without a cache are 15 ns and 30 ns, so the ranking from shortest is 15, 17, 30, 40.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'computer-architecture'),
  'medium',
