  '[{"label":"a","text":"Freeware"},{"label":"b","text":"Package software"},{"label":"c","text":"Public domain software"},{"label":"d","text":"Shareware"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is freeware. Freeware can be used free of charge, but the author keeps the copyright and can restrict modification and redistribution. Public domain software has no copyright restrictions at all, and shareware may be tried for free but requires payment for continued use.',
