  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is a logical check. A logical check tests whether a value makes sense in relation to other data or business rules, such as an order date being a business day on or before the entry date. A format check only verifies the type and form of a field, and a sequence check verifies that records or numbers are in the expected order.',
