  'Q30. Multiple PCs are connected to the Internet with FTTH. The WAN interface of device A has a single global IP address allocated to it. Which of the following is the function of device A that enables these PCs to connect to the Internet by sharing the global IP address?',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q30. Multiple PCs are connected to the Internet with FTTH. The WAN interface of device A has a single global IP address allocated to it. Which of the following is the function of device A that enables these PCs to connect to the Internet by sharing the global IP address?"}]'::jsonb,
