  '[{"label":"a","text":"Hashing algorithm"},{"label":"b","text":"Key generation algorithm"},{"label":"c","text":"Signature verification algorithm"},{"label":"d","text":"Signing algorithm"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the key generation algorithm, which produces the matching public key and private key pair used in PKI. The signing algorithm uses the private key to create a signature, the verification algorithm uses the public key to check it, and a hashing algorithm produces a message digest rather than keys.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'cryptography'),
