  '[{"label":"a","text":"Activity diagram"},{"label":"b","text":"Communication diagram"},{"label":"c","text":"Interaction overview diagram"},{"label":"d","text":"Use case diagram"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the use case diagram. It shows the actors outside the system, the use cases (functions) they perform, and the relationships between them, giving a high-level overview of system functionality. Activity and interaction overview diagrams show flows of control, and communication diagrams show messages between objects.',
