  '[{"label":"a","text":"Critical path method (CPM)"},{"label":"b","text":"Gantt chart (Gantt)"},{"label":"c","text":"Program evaluation and review technique (PERT)"},{"label":"d","text":"Work breakdown structure (WBS)"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the work breakdown structure (WBS), a hierarchical, deliverable-oriented decomposition of the total project scope into smaller, manageable work packages. CPM and PERT are scheduling techniques for finding the critical path, and a Gantt chart displays a schedule against time.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'project-management'),
