  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct answer is 26 days. Working forward, the node after A is reached at day 3, the node after E at 3 + 11 = 14, and the node before H at max(3 + 7, 8 + 7, 14 via the dummy) = 15. The node before I is reached at max(14 + 8, 15 + 6) = 22, and adding I gives 22 + 4 = 26, so the critical path is A-E-G-I.',
