  'A',
  60,
  'Q60. Which of the following is subject to system audits that evaluate and verify internal
 controls related to IT?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,515.56,136.21],"text":"Q60.\nWhich of the following is subject to system audits that evaluate and verify internal\ncontrols related to IT?\n\na) Methods for ensuring accuracy when the sales department inputs into and updates the"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,529.32,172.21],"text":"database\nb) The process by which the business planning department leads the creation of a mid-term"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,526.3,226.21],"text":"business plan\nc) The results of employee personnel evaluations led by the personnel department\nd) The status of production equipment review conducted by the manufacturing department"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[102.12,230.93,272.74,244.21],"text":"for the purpose of reducing defects"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Methods for ensuring accuracy when the sales department inputs into and updates the\n database"},{"label":"b","text":"The process by which the business planning department leads the creation of a mid-term\n business plan"},{"label":"c","text":"The results of employee personnel evaluations led by the personnel department"},{"label":"d","text":"The status of production equipment review conducted by the manufacturing department\n for the purpose of reducing defects"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the methods for ensuring accuracy when the sales department inputs and updates the database. A system audit evaluates IT-related controls, such as input checks and data integrity in information systems. Mid-term business planning, personnel evaluations and production equipment reviews are business activities that do not concern IT controls.',
