  '[{"type":"text","page":30,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,525.55,118.21],"text":"Q79.\nIn financial statements, which of the following shows the company’s assets, liabilities,\nand net assets at a certain point in time and indicates the company’s financial situation?"},{"type":"text","page":30,"bbox":[65.22,122.93,455.7,172.21],"text":"a) Balance sheet\nb) Statement of cash flows\nc) Statement of changes in equity\nd) Statement of profit or loss"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Balance sheet"},{"label":"b","text":"Statement of cash flows"},{"label":"c","text":"Statement of changes in equity"},{"label":"d","text":"Statement of profit or loss"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct choice is the balance sheet, which shows assets, liabilities and net assets at a specific point in time, describing the company''s financial position. The statement of profit or loss shows revenues and expenses over a period, and the statement of cash flows shows cash movements over a period.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'finance'),
