  '[{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[65.22,428.93,533.13,459.25],"text":"Q3. When two dice are rolled, what is the probability that the sum of the dice is 5? Here, the two"},{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[65.22,463.85,231.0,495.13],"text":"dice are fair and independent."},{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[65.22,498.08,466.31,549.13],"text":"a)\n1/18\nb) 1/12\nc) 1/9\nd) 1/6"}]'::jsonb,
