 Here, the first element A(1,1) is mapped to the same starting memory address in either case.

 a) 2 b) 3 c) 4 d) 5',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[4]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
