  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The availability is about 0.94. For the left part (at least 2 of 3 working): all three work with 0.9 × 0.8 × 0.9 = 0.648, and exactly two work with 0.072 + 0.162 + 0.072 = 0.306, giving 0.954. The right part works if either device works: 1 − 0.1 × 0.1 = 0.99. The two parts are in series, so 0.954 × 0.99 ≈ 0.944, which rounds to 0.94.',
