  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q20. A half adder is a logic circuit that performs the addition of two single-bit binary numbers and outputs the sum and carry. The truth table of a half adder is shown in the table below. Which of the following is an appropriate logic diagram of the half adder?\n\nInputs | | Outputs |\nA | B | C (Carry) | S (Sum)\n0 | 0 | 0 | 0\n0 | 1 | 0 | 1\n1 | 0 | 0 | 1\n1 | 1 | 1 | 0"}]'::jsonb,
