  31,
  'Q31. Which of the following is a TCP/IP protocol that is used to find the corresponding MAC
 address from an IP address?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,413.76,533.22,462.13],"text":"Q31.\nWhich of the following is a TCP/IP protocol that is used to find the corresponding MAC\naddress from an IP address?"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,485.93,489.45,516.13],"text":"a) ARP\nb) ICMP\nc) IP\nd) RARP"}]'::jsonb,
