  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'ARP (Address Resolution Protocol) broadcasts a request asking which host owns a given IP address, and that host replies with its MAC address. RARP does the reverse (MAC to IP), ICMP carries error and diagnostic messages, and IP handles addressing and routing of packets.',
