),
(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  35,
  'Q35. The three properties of information security are confidentiality, integrity, and availability.
 Which of the following is an attack on integrity?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,140.76,533.1,189.13],"text":"Q35.\nThe three properties of information security are confidentiality, integrity, and availability.\nWhich of the following is an attack on integrity?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,212.93,428.17,262.15],"text":"a) DDoS\nb) Phishing\nc) Shoulder surfing\nd) Website defacement"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"DDoS"},{"label":"b","text":"Phishing"},{"label":"c","text":"Shoulder surfing"},{"label":"d","text":"Website defacement"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Website defacement attacks integrity because it changes a site''s content without authorization, so the information is no longer accurate and complete. DDoS attacks availability, and phishing and shoulder surfing steal information, which attacks confidentiality.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'security-threats'),
  'medium',
