),
(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  37,
  'Q37. Which of the following is a cyber-attack that redirects a victim to a fake website by
 manipulating DNS to obtain personal information from the victim?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,411.28,533.15,459.13],"text":"Q37.\nWhich of the following is a cyber-attack that redirects a victim to a fake website by\nmanipulating DNS to obtain personal information from the victim?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,482.93,519.06,514.21],"text":"a) Pharming\nb) Phishing\nc) Spamming\nd) Trojan horse"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Pharming"},{"label":"b","text":"Phishing"},{"label":"c","text":"Spamming"},{"label":"d","text":"Trojan horse"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Pharming manipulates DNS, for example by poisoning a DNS cache or altering the hosts file, so that even a correctly typed URL leads the victim to a fake site that collects personal data. Phishing usually relies on fake emails or links to lure the victim, rather than on tampering with name resolution.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'security-threats'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2022A, FE, Subject-A, Q37)',
