  'Q37. Which of the following is a cyber-attack that redirects a victim to a fake website by
 manipulating DNS to obtain personal information from the victim?

 a) Pharming b) Phishing c) Spamming d) Trojan horse',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[13]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  38,
  'Q38. When security risk management processes incorporate the approach of the PDCA (Plan,
 Do, Check, Act) cycle, which of the following is a process that belongs to Act?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,519.28,533.1,567.13],"text":"Q38.\nWhen security risk management processes incorporate the approach of the PDCA (Plan,\nDo, Check, Act) cycle, which of the following is a process that belongs to Act?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[70.86,590.93,512.41,676.21],"text":"a) Establish a security policy and develop a security risk management plan.\nb) Implement the security risk management plan.\nc) Maintain and improve the security risk management plan by learning from incidents.\nd) Monitor the security risks as planned in the risk management plan."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Establish a security policy and develop a security risk management plan."},{"label":"b","text":"Implement the security risk management plan."},{"label":"c","text":"Maintain and improve the security risk management plan by learning from incidents."},{"label":"d","text":"Monitor the security risks as planned in the risk management plan."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Act is the improvement step: the risk management plan is maintained and improved based on lessons from incidents and monitoring results. Establishing the policy and plan is Plan, implementing the plan is Do, and monitoring the risks as planned is Check.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'security-threats'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2022A, FE, Subject-A, Q38)',
  ARRAY[13]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q38. When security risk management processes incorporate the approach of the PDCA (Plan,
 Do, Check, Act) cycle, which of the following is a process that belongs to Act?

 a) Establish a security policy and develop a security risk management plan.
 b) Implement the security risk management plan.
 c) Maintain and improve the security risk management plan by learning from incidents.
 d) Monitor the security risks as planned in the risk management plan.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[13]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  39,
  'Q39. Which of the following is the protocol that is used together with HTTP in HTTPS?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,680.93,508.18,711.25],"text":"Q39.\nWhich of the following is the protocol that is used together with HTTP in HTTPS?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[84.12,716.93,467.92,748.21],"text":"a) SHA\nb) SSH\nc) TLS\nd) VPN"},{"type":"code","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,794.45,315.66,807.79],"text":"– 13 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"SHA"},{"label":"b","text":"SSH"},{"label":"c","text":"TLS"},{"label":"d","text":"VPN"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'HTTPS is HTTP carried over TLS (Transport Layer Security, the successor of SSL). TLS provides encryption, server authentication with certificates, and integrity checking. SSH is a separate secure remote-login protocol, SHA is a hash function family, and a VPN is a network-level tunnel.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'network-security'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
