(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  49,
  'Q49. Among the software development activities, which of the following corresponds to
 refactoring that is emphasized in agile development?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,211.86,533.11,261.13],"text":"Q49.\nAmong the software development activities, which of the following corresponds to\nrefactoring that is emphasized in agile development?"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[84.12,266.93,501.07,298.21],"text":"a) To improve the maintainability of a program, the internal structure of a program is"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[84.12,302.93,517.68,334.21],"text":"changed without any change in the external specifications.\nb) To improve the quality of a program, two (2) programmers cooperate and perform the"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[84.12,338.93,506.31,370.21],"text":"coding of one (1) program.\nc) To obtain feedback from the users, a prototype of the software is created at an early"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[84.12,374.93,517.18,406.21],"text":"stage.\nd) To promptly develop a program, test cases are set in advance, and then the program is"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,410.93,136.8,442.21],"text":"coded."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"To improve the maintainability of a program, the internal structure of a program is\n changed without any change in the external specifications."},{"label":"b","text":"To improve the quality of a program, two (2) programmers cooperate and perform the\n coding of one (1) program."},{"label":"c","text":"To obtain feedback from the users, a prototype of the software is created at an early\n stage."},{"label":"d","text":"To promptly develop a program, test cases are set in advance, and then the program is\n coded."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Refactoring improves a program''s internal structure, for example its readability or by removing duplication, without changing its external behavior, which makes it easier to maintain. Choice b is pair programming, c is prototyping, and d is test-driven development.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'development-processes'),
