  50,
  'Q50. In eXtreme Programming (XP), which of the following is advocated as a practice?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,446.93,505.8,477.25],"text":"Q50.\nIn eXtreme Programming (XP), which of the following is advocated as a practice?"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,482.93,424.48,550.21],"text":"a) Inspection\nb) Pair programming\nc) Structured design\nd) Use case utilization"}]'::jsonb,
