  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Pair programming is one of XP''s core practices: two developers work at one workstation, one writing code and the other reviewing it continuously. Other XP practices include test-driven development, refactoring and continuous integration. Formal inspection and structured design belong to traditional plan-driven methods.',
