(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  51,
  'Q51. A project consisting of several activities has a single critical path. Which of the following
 is an appropriate description of critical path activities for the project?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,572.76,533.16,622.21],"text":"Q51.\nA project consisting of several activities has a single critical path. Which of the following\nis an appropriate description of critical path activities for the project?"},{"type":"text","page":16,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,523.03,694.21],"text":"a) Critical path activities can be performed in parallel.\nb) Critical path activities have a non-zero total float time.\nc) For each critical path activity, the early start date equals the late start date.\nd) The activity with the longest duration in the project is one of the critical path activities."},{"type":"code","page":16,"bbox":[65.22,794.45,315.66,807.79],"text":"– 16 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Critical path activities can be performed in parallel."},{"label":"b","text":"Critical path activities have a non-zero total float time."},{"label":"c","text":"For each critical path activity, the early start date equals the late start date."},{"label":"d","text":"The activity with the longest duration in the project is one of the critical path activities."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Activities on the critical path have zero total float, so the earliest start date equals the latest start date and any delay to them delays the whole project. They are performed in sequence, not in parallel. The single longest activity need not be on the critical path, because the path is determined by the longest total chain.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'project-management'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2022A, FE, Subject-A, Q51)',
  ARRAY[16]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q51. A project consisting of several activities has a single critical path. Which of the following
 is an appropriate description of critical path activities for the project?

 a) Critical path activities can be performed in parallel.
 b) Critical path activities have a non-zero total float time.
 c) For each critical path activity, the early start date equals the late start date.
 d) The activity with the longest duration in the project is one of the critical path activities.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[16]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
