  'Q52. Which of the following is an appropriate description of the Responsibility Assignment
 Matrix that is used for project human resource management?

 a) Allocating work packages to those who are responsible for project work
 b) Defining the limits of the project sponsor’s responsibilities
 c) Defining the terms of reference of the project
 d) Monitoring the current engagement level of stakeholders',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[17]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2022-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
