  '["2022-october-a-q65-figure1.webp"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Concluding a contract"},{"label":"b","text":"RFI"},{"label":"c","text":"RFP"},{"label":"d","text":"Selecting a provider"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Step B is the RFP (Request for Proposal), in which the orderer specifies the target system and procurement conditions and asks vendors to submit proposals. Step A, which asks for general information, is the RFI, C is selecting a provider based on the proposals, and D is concluding a contract that confirms roles and responsibilities.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'procurement'),
