  66,
  'Q66. In a growth matrix proposed by Ansoff, which of the following is a strategy for expanding
 a business with an existing product in an existing market?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[65.22,393.78,533.17,425.11],"text":"Q66.\nIn a growth matrix proposed by Ansoff, which of the following is a strategy for expanding\na business with an existing product in an existing market?"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[74.1,430.91,438.8,498.19],"text":"a) Diversification\nb) Market development\nc) Market penetration\nd) Product development"}]'::jsonb,
