  '[{"label":"a","text":"Diversification"},{"label":"b","text":"Market development"},{"label":"c","text":"Market penetration"},{"label":"d","text":"Product development"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'In Ansoff''s matrix, selling existing products in existing markets is market penetration, for example increasing market share or usage. Market development takes existing products to new markets, product development offers new products in existing markets, and diversification offers new products in new markets.',
