  'Q75. Which of the following is a management organization that has the characteristic of both
 project and functional organizations being able to flexibly respond to changes in the business
 environment?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,553.8,533.12,621.13],"text":"Q75.\nWhich of the following is a management organization that has the characteristic of both\nproject and functional organizations being able to flexibly respond to changes in the business\nenvironment?"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,626.76,452.8,658.21],"text":"a) Divisional organization\nb) Hierarchical organization\nc) Line and staff organization\nd) Matrix organization"},{"type":"code","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,794.45,315.66,807.79],"text":"– 25 –"}]'::jsonb,
