  '[{"type":"text","page":26,"bbox":[65.22,67.8,533.11,99.13],"text":"Q76.\nWhich of the following is a process of discovering useful patterns and relationships by\nthe analysis of large volumes of data?"},{"type":"text","page":26,"bbox":[65.22,122.93,422.18,172.21],"text":"a) Brainstorming\nb) Data mining\nc) Decision tree\nd) Document analysis"}]'::jsonb,
