(
  '2022-october',
  'A',
  78,
  'Q78. Company A purchased a machine for the original cost of $126,000. The salvage value
 after 6 years is $6,000. What is the annual depreciation expense (in dollars) by using the
 straight-line method?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":26,"bbox":[65.22,337.8,533.14,387.13],"text":"Q78.\nCompany A purchased a machine for the original cost of $126,000. The salvage value\nafter 6 years is $6,000. What is the annual depreciation expense (in dollars) by using the\nstraight-line method?"},{"type":"text","page":26,"bbox":[84.12,410.93,476.88,424.21],"text":"a) 12,000\nb) 20,000\nc) 21,000\nd) 36,000"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"12,000"},{"label":"b","text":"20,000"},{"label":"c","text":"21,000"},{"label":"d","text":"36,000"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The annual depreciation is 20,000 dollars. The straight-line method spreads (cost − salvage value) evenly over the useful life: (126,000 − 6,000) ÷ 6 = 120,000 ÷ 6 = 20,000 per year. Choice c (21,000) wrongly ignores the salvage value.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'finance'),
