  'Blanks A and B: for inputs 0,1,0,1,1,1,0,1 the states go S0,S1,S0,S1,S2,S2,S0,S1, and only S2 outputs 1, so the last four outputs are 1→1→0→0 and the final state is S1. Blank C: the present state in the last two rows is S2 and the next states are S0 (output 0) and S2 (output 1), so C is 0 over 1. Blank D: VN is 1 for (VP, ZP, I) = (0,1,1), whose minterm is NOT VP • ZP • I. Blank E: NOT VP•ZP•I + VP•ZP•I = ZP•I(NOT VP + VP) = ZP • I. Blank F: in every row ZN equals the input I (the code VP=1, ZP=0 never occurs), so ZN = I.',
