 ID,sets ***E*** , then
 displays the summary
 information.
 6. Clicks “Print QR and Logoff”
 or “Logoff”.
 7. If “Print QR and Logoff” is
 clicked, calls functions
 Generate QR and Print QR.
 Then terminate the process.

