  'Blank A: after the update step, assets are either 2 (updated) or 0 (not checked, including ones whose information was incomplete), so the accountant asks for a recheck of assets whose flag is 0. Blank B: generating and printing the sticker is optional within Register assets, so the relation is «extend» with the arrow pointing to Register assets (the X ← Y form in the note). Blanks C1 to C3: View assets is included by both Update assets and Report assets, while Scan QR code and View location are used only by Report assets, giving View assets, Scan QR code, View location. Blank D: the accountant selects the department and location in step 2, and the asset ID, condition and checking flag are set by the system, so the extra inputs are department and location. Blank E: on registration the system assigns the asset ID and sets the asset condition to Normal and the checking flag to 0, as stated in function (1).',
