 which of the following is the resulting value in hexadecimal?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[65.22,362.46,533.12,375.91],"text":"Q2.  When the hexadecimal value ABCD in a 32-bit register is logically shifted right by two bits,"},{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[80.28,380.63,376.88,393.91],"text":"which of the following is the resulting value in hexadecimal?"},{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[84.12,416.63,486.77,429.91],"text":"a) 2AF3\nb) 6AF3\nc) AF34\nd) EAF3"}]'::jsonb,
