 is divisible by the same polynomial?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,446.76,533.14,478.21],"text":"Q6.  Which of the following is an error detection method where, on the sender side, the data sent"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,482.93,533.18,550.21],"text":"accompanies a remainder of the data bit sequence divided by a specific generator polynomial,\nwhile on the receiver side, error detection is performed by checking if the received bit sequence\nis divisible by the same polynomial?"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,554.93,437.13,622.21],"text":"a) CRC\nb) Hamming code\nc) Horizontal parity check\nd) Vertical parity check"},{"type":"code","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 4 –"}]'::jsonb,
