  '[{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,533.15,118.21],"text":"Q13.\nWhich of the following is the technique that minimizes the number of write operations\nto the main memory by updating the data only in the cache memory and updating into the main\nmemory later?"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,140.93,517.43,172.15],"text":"a) Overlay\nb) Write back\nc) Write protected\nd) Write through"}]'::jsonb,
