  20,
  'Q20. Which of the following is the logic circuit that is equivalent to the logical expression A̅BC + AC?',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q20. Which of the following is the logic circuit that is equivalent to the logical expression A̅BC + AC?"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"","image":"2023-april-a-q20-choice-a.webp"},{"label":"b","text":"","image":"2023-april-a-q20-choice-b.webp"},{"label":"c","text":"","image":"2023-april-a-q20-choice-c.webp"},{"label":"d","text":"","image":"2023-april-a-q20-choice-d.webp"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The equivalent circuit ORs A and B and then ANDs the result with C. Factoring out C gives A̅BC + AC = C(A̅B + A), and A + A̅B = A + B, so the expression simplifies to (A + B)C. Choice d implements the expression directly but its gate inputs are wired as A̅B and BC, which is not the same function.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'computer-architecture'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
