 occurrence of 0.5 for the risk of malware infection. How much (in dollars) is the annual loss
 expectancy of the asset due to malware infection?

 a) 20,000 b) 40,000 c) 80,000 d) 100,000',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[15]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  42,
  'Q42. Which of the following is residual risk?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,392.93,300.85,442.21],"text":"Q42.\nWhich of the following is residual risk?"},{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,446.93,426.03,532.15],"text":"a) Amount of risk that is reduced by implementing risk treatment\nb) Risk that exists prior to performing any risk management activities\nc) Risk that is identified prior to implementing risk treatment\nd) Risk that remains after implementing risk treatment"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Amount of risk that is reduced by implementing risk treatment"},{"label":"b","text":"Risk that exists prior to performing any risk management activities"},{"label":"c","text":"Risk that is identified prior to implementing risk treatment"},{"label":"d","text":"Risk that remains after implementing risk treatment"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Residual risk is the risk that remains after risk treatment has been carried out. Controls rarely remove a risk entirely, so the organization must decide whether the remaining risk is acceptable. Risk that exists before any risk management is inherent risk.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'security-threats'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023S, FE, Subject-A, Q42)',
  ARRAY[15]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q42. Which of the following is residual risk?

 a) Amount of risk that is reduced by implementing risk treatment
 b) Risk that exists prior to performing any risk management activities
 c) Risk that is identified prior to implementing risk treatment
 d) Risk that remains after implementing risk treatment',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[15]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  43,
  'Q43. Which of the following is a security measure that allows users to run potentially
 malicious programs on a system with the purpose of observing their behavior, while restricting
 the programs from accessing outside of the system?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,536.76,533.22,604.21],"text":"Q43.\nWhich of the following is a security measure that allows users to run potentially\nmalicious programs on a system with the purpose of observing their behavior, while restricting\nthe programs from accessing outside of the system?"},{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,485.86,640.21],"text":"a) Firewall\nb) Honeypot\nc) IPS\nd) Sandbox"},{"type":"code","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 15 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Firewall"},{"label":"b","text":"Honeypot"},{"label":"c","text":"IPS"},{"label":"d","text":"Sandbox"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The measure is a sandbox, an isolated environment where suspicious programs can run and be observed without being able to reach or damage anything outside it. A honeypot is a decoy system that lures attackers, and a firewall and an IPS filter or block traffic instead of running programs.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'network-security'),
  'medium',
