  '[{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,411.89,533.19,478.09],"text":"Q50.\nWhich of the following is the appropriate term for referring to activities such as creating\na class diagram in UML from a program?"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,483.89,433.74,533.17],"text":"a) Backtracking\nb) Forward engineering\nc) Reengineering\nd) Reverse engineering"}]'::jsonb,
