(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  51,
  'Q51. As for software development activities, which of the following is refactoring?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,555.72,516.27,605.17],"text":"Q51.\nAs for software development activities, which of the following is refactoring?\n\na) In order to improve the maintainability of a program, its internal structure is modified"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,609.89,530.04,641.17],"text":"without any change to the external specifications.\nb) In order to improve the quality of a program, two programmers cooperate to perform the"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,645.89,507.07,677.17],"text":"coding of a single program.\nc) In order to obtain feedback from users, the prototype of a program to be provided is"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,681.89,526.74,713.17],"text":"created at an early stage.\nd) In order to promptly develop a program to be operated, test cases are set in advance and"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[102.12,717.89,232.64,731.17],"text":"the program is then coded."},{"type":"code","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 18 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"In order to improve the maintainability of a program, its internal structure is modified\n without any change to the external specifications."},{"label":"b","text":"In order to improve the quality of a program, two programmers cooperate to perform the\n coding of a single program."},{"label":"c","text":"In order to obtain feedback from users, the prototype of a program to be provided is\n created at an early stage."},{"label":"d","text":"In order to promptly develop a program to be operated, test cases are set in advance and\n the program is then coded."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Refactoring means changing a program''s internal structure to improve maintainability without changing its external behaviour or specifications. The other choices describe pair programming, prototyping, and test-driven development.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'software-development'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023S, FE, Subject-A, Q51)',
  ARRAY[18]::int[],
  'native_text',
