 project?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,533.11,136.21],"text":"Q52.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate description of the stakeholders involved in a\nproject?\n\na) Some stakeholders receive the project result advantageously and others"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,498.45,208.21],"text":"disadvantageously.\nb) The stakeholders are individually identified people, such as project managers.\nc) The stakeholders belong within the organization and do not exist outside of it.\nd) The stakeholders participate directly in the project; they are not limited to indirect"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,212.93,168.13,244.21],"text":"involvement."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Some stakeholders receive the project result advantageously and others\n disadvantageously."},{"label":"b","text":"The stakeholders are individually identified people, such as project managers."},{"label":"c","text":"The stakeholders belong within the organization and do not exist outside of it."},{"label":"d","text":"The stakeholders participate directly in the project; they are not limited to indirect\n involvement."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Some stakeholders are affected by the project result advantageously and others disadvantageously. Stakeholders are any individuals, groups, or organizations that affect or are affected by the project, so they can be outside the organization, can be groups rather than named people, and can be only indirectly involved.',
