  '[{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,248.76,533.12,316.21],"text":"Q53.\nIn project management, which of the following is the subject group that includes\nprocesses having Purpose 1 and those having Purpose 2?"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[101.34,320.93,155.6,334.21],"text":"[Purposes]"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,338.93,533.23,513.13],"text":"Purpose 1:\nTo clarify the objectives, deliverables, requirements, and boundaries of the\nproject\nPurpose 2:\nTo maximize the positive impacts to the project and minimize the negative\nimpacts, both of which occur as a result of changes in the objectives and\ndeliverables of the project\n\na) Communication\nb) Procurement\nc) Risk\nd) Scope"}]'::jsonb,
