  56,
  'Q56. When an IT service is discontinued, it is important to comprehensively identify the assets
 that were used and appropriately remove or free surplus assets. Which of the following is an
 event that may occur due to mistaken removal of assets that should remain, but does not
 occur because of the removal of assets that should be removed?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":20,"bbox":[65.22,410.76,533.12,496.21],"text":"Q56.\nWhen an IT service is discontinued, it is important to comprehensively identify the assets\nthat were used and appropriately remove or free surplus assets. Which of the following is an\nevent that may occur due to mistaken removal of assets that should remain, but does not\noccur because of the removal of assets that should be removed?"},{"type":"text","page":20,"bbox":[91.98,500.93,533.11,514.21],"text":"a) Occurrence of incidents involving other IT services that share assets with the"},{"type":"text","page":20,"bbox":[91.98,518.93,384.84,586.21],"text":"discontinued IT service\nb) Overpaying software or hardware maintenance charges\nc) Wasting money on software licenses\nd) Wasting space that becomes unused on magnetic disks"},{"type":"code","page":20,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 20 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Occurrence of incidents involving other IT services that share assets with the\n discontinued IT service"},{"label":"b","text":"Overpaying software or hardware maintenance charges"},{"label":"c","text":"Wasting money on software licenses"},{"label":"d","text":"Wasting space that becomes unused on magnetic disks"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Incidents in other IT services that share assets with the discontinued service occur only if assets that should remain are removed by mistake. Overpaying maintenance charges, wasting license fees, and wasting disk space are the results of failing to remove surplus assets, not of removing too much.',
