(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  72,
  'Q72. Which of the following is an explanation of a sharing economy?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,418.75,81.19],"text":"Q72.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of a sharing economy?"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,86.93,516.58,118.21],"text":"a) It is a concept by which efficient management and operation of renewable energy and"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,122.93,515.72,172.21],"text":"urban infrastructure are performed by using IT, which leads to an improvement in the\nquality of peoples’ lives and helps achieve continuous economic growth.\nb) It is a concept by which the productivity of an entire economy increases as a result of"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,506.75,226.21],"text":"utilizing IT, and the supply and demand gap is eliminated via the progress of SCM,\nwhich leads to sustainable growth free from inflation.\nc) It is a mechanism by which sales both over-the-counter and through the Internet are"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,230.93,513.94,280.21],"text":"combined in a business transaction, and the benefits of both are utilized and linked to\nexpand overall sales.\nd) It is a mechanism mainly between individuals by which the community function and"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,284.93,499.37,334.21],"text":"other functions of social media are utilized to share, lend, or borrow unused assets\nowned by individuals."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is a concept by which efficient management and operation of renewable energy and\n urban infrastructure are performed by using IT, which leads to an improvement in the\n quality of peoples’ lives and helps achieve continuous economic growth."},{"label":"b","text":"It is a concept by which the productivity of an entire economy increases as a result of\n utilizing IT, and the supply and demand gap is eliminated via the progress of SCM,\n which leads to sustainable growth free from inflation."},{"label":"c","text":"It is a mechanism by which sales both over-the-counter and through the Internet are\n combined in a business transaction, and the benefits of both are utilized and linked to\n expand overall sales."},{"label":"d","text":"It is a mechanism mainly between individuals by which the community function and\n other functions of social media are utilized to share, lend, or borrow unused assets\n owned by individuals."}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'A sharing economy is a mainly person-to-person mechanism that uses social media and community functions to share, lend, or borrow unused assets owned by individuals, such as rooms or cars. The other choices describe a smart city, the ''new economy'' concept, and omni-channel or click-and-mortar retailing.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023S, FE, Subject-A, Q72)',
  ARRAY[27]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q72. Which of the following is an explanation of a sharing economy?

 a) It is a concept by which efficient management and operation of renewable energy and
 urban infrastructure are performed by using IT, which leads to an improvement in the
 quality of peoples’ lives and helps achieve continuous economic growth.
 b) It is a concept by which the productivity of an entire economy increases as a result of
 utilizing IT, and the supply and demand gap is eliminated via the progress of SCM,
 which leads to sustainable growth free from inflation.
 c) It is a mechanism by which sales both over-the-counter and through the Internet are
 combined in a business transaction, and the benefits of both are utilized and linked to
 expand overall sales.
 d) It is a mechanism mainly between individuals by which the community function and
 other functions of social media are utilized to share, lend, or borrow unused assets
 owned by individuals.',
