  true
),
(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  73,
  'Q73. Which of the following is an appropriate explanation of digital signage?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[65.22,356.76,478.05,424.21],"text":"Q73.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate explanation of digital signage?\n\na) A technology to embed identification information in data to prevent abuse\nb) An economic or social gap among regions or individuals, arising from lack of"},{"type":"text","page":27,"bbox":[84.12,428.93,486.27,478.21],"text":"opportunities and abilities to utilize information technology\nc) An electronic billboard that displays information such as images and characters\nd) An electronic signature that is used to ensure the validity of information"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A technology to embed identification information in data to prevent abuse"},{"label":"b","text":"An economic or social gap among regions or individuals, arising from lack of\n opportunities and abilities to utilize information technology"},{"label":"c","text":"An electronic billboard that displays information such as images and characters"},{"label":"d","text":"An electronic signature that is used to ensure the validity of information"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Digital signage is an electronic billboard that uses displays to show information such as images, video, and text in public places. Embedding identification information is digital watermarking, the information gap is the digital divide, and the electronic signature choice describes a digital signature.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
