(
  '2023-april',
  'A',
  75,
  'Q75. Which of the following is a characteristic of OJT?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":28,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,508.66,136.21],"text":"Q75.\nWhich of the following is a characteristic of OJT?\n\na) A dedicated approach to education is possible outside of the workplace.\nb) Because the boss or senior accosiates provide education in hands-on knowledge and"},{"type":"text","page":28,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,517.74,208.21],"text":"technical skills by staying close to practical affairs, the required competency can be\nacquired.\nc) Education that focuses on generalized knowledge and technology can be acquired.\nd) Regardless of the ability of the boss or senior associates, occupational knowledge of a"},{"type":"text","page":28,"bbox":[102.12,212.93,267.38,226.21],"text":"specific standard can be acquired."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A dedicated approach to education is possible outside of the workplace."},{"label":"b","text":"Because the boss or senior accosiates provide education in hands-on knowledge and\n technical skills by staying close to practical affairs, the required competency can be\n acquired."},{"label":"c","text":"Education that focuses on generalized knowledge and technology can be acquired."},{"label":"d","text":"Regardless of the ability of the boss or senior associates, occupational knowledge of a\n specific standard can be acquired."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'In OJT (on-the-job training) a boss or senior colleague teaches practical knowledge and skills during real work, so the competencies actually needed in the job are learned. Dedicated education outside the workplace and generalized knowledge describe Off-JT, and the quality of OJT does depend on the ability of the person teaching.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023S, FE, Subject-A, Q75)',
  ARRAY[28]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q75. Which of the following is a characteristic of OJT?

 a) A dedicated approach to education is possible outside of the workplace.
 b) Because the boss or senior accosiates provide education in hands-on knowledge and
 technical skills by staying close to practical affairs, the required competency can be
 acquired.
 c) Education that focuses on generalized knowledge and technology can be acquired.
 d) Regardless of the ability of the boss or senior associates, occupational knowledge of a
 specific standard can be acquired.',
