  '[{"label":"a","text":"240,000"},{"label":"b","text":"320,000"},{"label":"c","text":"480,000"},{"label":"d","text":"560,000"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Break-even sales are $320,000. The variable cost ratio is 48 / 80 = 0.6, so the contribution margin ratio is 0.4, and break-even sales = fixed cost / 0.4 = 128,000 / 0.4 = $320,000 (equivalently 4,000 units × $80).',
