 students play both. Further, 7 students play neither. How many students are there in the
 class?

 a) 17 b) 31 c) 33 d) 47',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[3]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
