(
  '2023-october',
  'A',
  4,
  'Q4. What is the sum of two binary fractions 1.0101 and 1.0111 expressed in decimal form?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[65.22,455.87,516.56,486.13],"text":"Q4.  What is the sum of two binary fractions 1.0101 and 1.0111 expressed in decimal form?"},{"type":"text","page":3,"bbox":[84.12,509.87,491.1,523.15],"text":"a) 2.5\nb) 2.75\nc) 2.875\nd) 2.9375"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"2.5"},{"label":"b","text":"2.75"},{"label":"c","text":"2.875"},{"label":"d","text":"2.9375"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The sum is 2.75. Binary 1.0101 = 1 + 1/4 + 1/16 = 1.3125 and 1.0111 = 1 + 1/4 + 1/8 + 1/16 = 1.4375, so their sum is 2.75. Equivalently, adding in binary gives 10.1100, which is 2 + 0.5 + 0.25 = 2.75.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'computer-architecture'),
  'medium',
