  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q9. In the table below, there are five items A through E. Each item cannot be divided into smaller pieces. When a knapsack with a maximum volume of 7 units is used for carrying the items, which of the following is a set of items to be packed in the knapsack so that the total price can be maximized?\n\nItem | Volume | Price\nA | 3 | 4\nB | 2 | 3\nC | 3 | 5\nD | 1 | 2\nE | 5 | 9"}]'::jsonb,
