  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The best set is B and E, with volume 2 + 5 = 7 and price 3 + 9 = 12. Other sets that fit give less: A, C, D has volume 7 but price 11; D, E has price 11; A, B, D has price 9. Because items cannot be split, this 0/1 knapsack problem is solved by comparing feasible combinations, not by taking items greedily.',
