 next instruction to be fetched?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":5,"bbox":[65.22,533.34,516.5,582.73],"text":"Q11.\nIn a CPU, which of the following is a special register that contains the address of the\nnext instruction to be fetched?"},{"type":"text","page":5,"bbox":[65.22,587.51,410.85,671.71],"text":"a) Accumulator\nb) Index register\nc) Instruction register\nd) Program counter"},{"type":"code","page":5,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 5 –"}]'::jsonb,
