 data management utilities?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,555.28,533.11,622.21],"text":"Q19.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of the function of an archiver that is one of the\ndata management utilities?"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,497.37,640.21],"text":"a) Compiling several files into one file or reconstructing the original files in order to"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,644.93,524.32,676.21],"text":"perform data backup and distribution\nb) Creating both an area for recording data and an area for managing data on a single hard"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,680.93,529.36,712.21],"text":"disk\nc) Keeping data secure through file protection for safeguarding data from unauthorized use"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,716.93,522.63,748.21],"text":"and destruction, and also through copy protection for preventing unauthorized copying\nd) Rearranging a file into contiguous areas, to the extent possible, on a hard disk in which"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[102.12,752.93,236.44,766.21],"text":"fragmentation has occurred"},{"type":"code","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 7 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Compiling several files into one file or reconstructing the original files in order to\n perform data backup and distribution"},{"label":"b","text":"Creating both an area for recording data and an area for managing data on a single hard\n disk"},{"label":"c","text":"Keeping data secure through file protection for safeguarding data from unauthorized use\n and destruction, and also through copy protection for preventing unauthorized copying"},{"label":"d","text":"Rearranging a file into contiguous areas, to the extent possible, on a hard disk in which\n fragmentation has occurred"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'An archiver combines several files into one archive file, often compressing them, and can restore the original files, which is useful for backup and distribution. Creating recording and management areas on a disk describes formatting, and rearranging fragmented files into contiguous areas describes defragmentation.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'operating-systems'),
