  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The log file (journal) records the before-image and after-image of each database update as its history. Before-images are used to roll back incomplete transactions and after-images to roll forward from a backup. A backup or dump file is a copy of the database at a point in time, and a checkpoint marks a point where buffers were written to disk.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'databases'),
