  '[{"type":"text","page":10,"bbox":[65.22,502.74,532.77,624.13],"text":"Q30.\nWhich of the following is the most appropriate information for a router to determine the\ndestination of an incoming packet?\n\na) Destination IP address\nb) Destination MAC address\nc) Source IP address\nd) Source MAC address"}]'::jsonb,
