  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,500.76,532.19,568.21],"text":"Q42.\n Companies usually provide a means for their mobile workforce to access the corporate\nnetwork securely over the Internet through insecure channels such as open wireless\nnetworks in hotels or coffee shops. Which of the following is the appropriate technology\nthat can be used for this purpose?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,590.93,337.03,694.21],"text":"a) DMZ (DeMilitarized Zone)\nb) SNMP (Simple Network Management Protocol)\nc) VoIP (Voice over Internet Protocol)\nd) VPN (Virtual Private Network)"},{"type":"code","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 13 –"}]'::jsonb,
