  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'A VPN creates an encrypted, authenticated tunnel across the Internet, so mobile workers on untrusted networks such as hotel Wi-Fi can reach the corporate network securely. A DMZ is a network segment for public-facing servers, SNMP is for network management and VoIP carries voice calls.',
