  '[{"type":"text","page":14,"bbox":[65.22,517.74,533.2,567.13],"text":"Q46.\nThe integration test for software composed of modules arranged in a hierarchical\nstructure is performed from a high-level module. In such a case, which of the following is a\ntest module that is used as a substitute for a low-level module?"},{"type":"text","page":14,"bbox":[84.12,590.93,375.14,622.21],"text":"a) Driver\nb) Emulator\nc) Simulator\nd) Stub"},{"type":"code","page":14,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 14 –"}]'::jsonb,
