 described with E-R diagrams or other representations from the definition information in an
 active database?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,536.93,533.17,603.13],"text":"Q50.\nWhich of the following is a method that uses a modeling tool to create a design document\ndescribed with E-R diagrams or other representations from the definition information in an\nactive database?"},{"type":"text","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,626.93,436.67,676.21],"text":"a) Concurrent engineering\nb) Forward engineering\nc) Reverse engineering\nd) Social engineering"},{"type":"code","page":15,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 15 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Concurrent engineering"},{"label":"b","text":"Forward engineering"},{"label":"c","text":"Reverse engineering"},{"label":"d","text":"Social engineering"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Reverse engineering works backward from an existing product, here generating E-R diagrams and design documents from the definition information of a running database. Forward engineering goes the other way, from design to implementation, concurrent engineering runs development stages in parallel and social engineering is a security attack that manipulates people.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'software-development'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q50)',
