  '2023-october',
  'A',
  53,
  'Q53. When the number of programs composing the system and the number of person-days required for coding per program are as shown in the table below, what is the minimum number of staff members required to develop the system in 95 days? Here, in addition to coding, the activities of design and testing are also necessary to develop the system, and those activities require eight times as many person-days as coding.',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q53. When the number of programs composing the system and the number of person-days required for coding per program are as shown in the table below, what is the minimum number of staff members required to develop the system in 95 days? Here, in addition to coding, the activities of design and testing are also necessary to develop the system, and those activities require eight times as many person-days as coding."}]'::jsonb,
  '["2023-october-a-q53-figure1.webp"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"8"},{"label":"b","text":"9"},{"label":"c","text":"12"},{"label":"d","text":"13"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'At least 9 staff members are needed. Coding takes 20 × 1 + 10 × 3 + 5 × 9 = 95 person-days, and design and testing take 8 × 95 = 760, for a total of 95 × 9 = 855 person-days. Dividing by 95 days gives 855 ÷ 95 = 9 people. Forgetting to add coding itself to the eight-times figure gives 8.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'project-management'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q53)',
  ARRAY[17]::int[],
  'manual_review',
  '3.0',
  'Q53. When the number of programs composing the system and the number of person-days
 required for coding per program are as shown in the table below, what is the minimum
 number of staff members required to develop the system in 95 days? Here, in addition to
 coding, the activities of design and testing are also necessary to develop the system, and
 those activities require eight times as many person-days as coding.

 Number of person-days required
 Number of programs
 for coding per program

 Input processing 20 1

 Output processing 10 3

 Calculation processing 5 9

 a) 8 b) 9 c) 12 d) 13',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[17]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
