  'A',
  54,
  'Q54. Which of the following is a critical path of the project activities shown in the arrow
 diagram below?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,348.0,510.37,379.45],"text":"Q54.\nWhich of the following is a critical path of the project activities shown in the arrow\ndiagram below?"},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,510.17,468.48,559.45],"text":"a) A → B → E → I → L\nb) A → C → D → E → H → K\nc) A → C → F → I → L\nd) A → C → G → J → L"}]'::jsonb,
  '["2023-october-a-q54-figure1.webp"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A → B → E → I → L"},{"label":"b","text":"A → C → D → E → H → K"},{"label":"c","text":"A → C → F → I → L"},{"label":"d","text":"A → C → G → J → L"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The critical path is A → C → G → J → L, which takes 2 + 3 + 4 + 2 + 3 = 14 days, the longest path through the network. The other routes are shorter: A → C → F → I → L takes 13 days, A → C → D → E → H → K takes 12 and A → B → E → I → L takes 11. Any delay on the 14-day path delays the whole project.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'project-management'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q54)',
  ARRAY[17]::int[],
  'manual_review',
  '3.0',
  'Q54. Which of the following is a critical path of the project activities shown in the arrow
 diagram below?

 a) A → B → E → I → L b) A → C → D → E → H → K
 c) A → C → F → I → L d) A → C → G → J → L',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[17]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
