  'A',
  55,
  'Q55. Which of the following is an appropriate policy for creating an SLA?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,564.17,520.08,721.45],"text":"Q55.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate policy for creating an SLA?\n\na) Setting a compensation as a penalty for every item that has a service level\nb) Setting a service level for every item that can be taken into consideration\nc) Setting a service level that is maintained into the future without any changes\nd) Setting a service level under the cost and needs of a service provider and its customers"},{"type":"code","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 17 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Setting a compensation as a penalty for every item that has a service level"},{"label":"b","text":"Setting a service level for every item that can be taken into consideration"},{"label":"c","text":"Setting a service level that is maintained into the future without any changes"},{"label":"d","text":"Setting a service level under the cost and needs of a service provider and its customers"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Service levels in an SLA should be agreed by balancing the customer''s needs against the cost of providing the service, for both the provider and the customer. Setting levels for every conceivable item or penalties for every item is impractical, and service levels should be reviewed and revised over time as business needs change.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'it-governance'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q55)',
  ARRAY[17]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q55. Which of the following is an appropriate policy for creating an SLA?

 a) Setting a compensation as a penalty for every item that has a service level
 b) Setting a service level for every item that can be taken into consideration
 c) Setting a service level that is maintained into the future without any changes
 d) Setting a service level under the cost and needs of a service provider and its customers',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[17]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
