),
(
  '2023-october',
  'A',
  60,
  'Q60. Which of the following is an appropriate description concerning a system audit team?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,284.76,521.4,334.21],"text":"Q60.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate description concerning a system audit team?\n\na) For an audit of the development progress in an information systems department, the"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,338.93,527.04,388.21],"text":"audit team consists of members of the information systems department who are familiar\nwith the details of the development.\nb) In order to enable the person requesting the audit to issue improvement instructions on"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,392.93,526.62,442.21],"text":"the basis of the audit report, the system audit team reports the audit results to the person\nrequesting the audit.\nc) When an audit of the information system is performed as a part of the business"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,446.93,523.23,478.21],"text":"operations audit, the audit team is formed by the members of the user’s department.\nd) When the system audit team accepts the help of an expert, the decisions concerning the"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[102.12,482.93,478.68,496.21],"text":"range of support, methods, and audit results is the responsibility of the expert."},{"type":"code","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 19 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"For an audit of the development progress in an information systems department, the\n audit team consists of members of the information systems department who are familiar\n with the details of the development."},{"label":"b","text":"In order to enable the person requesting the audit to issue improvement instructions on\n the basis of the audit report, the system audit team reports the audit results to the person\n requesting the audit."},{"label":"c","text":"When an audit of the information system is performed as a part of the business\n operations audit, the audit team is formed by the members of the user’s department."},{"label":"d","text":"When the system audit team accepts the help of an expert, the decisions concerning the\n range of support, methods, and audit results is the responsibility of the expert."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The system audit team reports its results to the person who requested the audit, typically top management, so that person can direct improvements based on the report. The other options break auditor independence by staffing the audit with the audited department or users, or wrongly shift responsibility for audit results to an outside expert instead of the audit team.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'it-governance'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q60)',
  ARRAY[19]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q60. Which of the following is an appropriate description concerning a system audit team?

 a) For an audit of the development progress in an information systems department, the
 audit team consists of members of the information systems department who are familiar
 with the details of the development.
 b) In order to enable the person requesting the audit to issue improvement instructions on
 the basis of the audit report, the system audit team reports the audit results to the person
 requesting the audit.
 c) When an audit of the information system is performed as a part of the business
 operations audit, the audit team is formed by the members of the user’s department.
 d) When the system audit team accepts the help of an expert, the decisions concerning the
 range of support, methods, and audit results is the responsibility of the expert.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[19]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2023-october',
  'A',
  61,
  'Q61. The purchase of two types of IT devices A and B is being examined. The payout period is set in consideration of the useful life of each of the devices. Which of the following is an appropriate description for the minimum amount of annual profit necessary to recover the amount of investment within the set payout period for A and B? Here, the annual profit is made evenly each year, and the interest rate is not considered.

 | A | B
Amount of investment (10,000 yen) | 90 | 300
Payout period (years) | 3 | 5',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q61. The purchase of two types of IT devices A and B is being examined. The payout period is set in consideration of the useful life of each of the devices. Which of the following is an appropriate description for the minimum amount of annual profit necessary to recover the amount of investment within the set payout period for A and B? Here, the annual profit is made evenly each year, and the interest rate is not considered.\n\n | A | B\nAmount of investment (10,000 yen) | 90 | 300\nPayout period (years) | 3 | 5"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is necessary for A and B to make the same amount of annual profit."},{"label":"b","text":"It is necessary for A to make twice as much as the annual profit than that of B."},{"label":"c","text":"It is necessary for B to make 1.5 times as much as the annual profit than that of A."},{"label":"d","text":"It is necessary for B to make twice as much as the annual profit than that of A."}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'B must earn twice as much annual profit as A. To recover the investment within the payout period, A needs 90 ÷ 3 = 30 and B needs 300 ÷ 5 = 60 (units of 10,000 yen) per year, and 60 is twice 30.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'finance'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q61)',
  ARRAY[20]::int[],
  'manual_review',
