(
  '2023-october',
  'A',
  64,
  'Q64. Which of the following is an appropriate example of utilizing Business Intelligence
 (BI)?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,510.49,136.21],"text":"Q64.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate example of utilizing Business Intelligence\n(BI)?\n\na) Analyzing a large volume of data stored on a business system to evaluate business"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,495.33,172.21],"text":"performance and develop a business strategy\nb) Computerizing daily routine works, such as decision requests, to ensure that such"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,530.61,208.21],"text":"procedures are carried out without fail and to enable their swift completion\nc) Enabling employees to use computerized learning materials via a network and managing"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,212.93,530.73,244.21],"text":"their learning and performance\nd) Obtaining publications, such as annual reports issued by competitors, to understand their"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,248.93,314.47,280.21],"text":"business strategies and financial situations"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Analyzing a large volume of data stored on a business system to evaluate business\n performance and develop a business strategy"},{"label":"b","text":"Computerizing daily routine works, such as decision requests, to ensure that such\n procedures are carried out without fail and to enable their swift completion"},{"label":"c","text":"Enabling employees to use computerized learning materials via a network and managing\n their learning and performance"},{"label":"d","text":"Obtaining publications, such as annual reports issued by competitors, to understand their\n business strategies and financial situations"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Business intelligence analyzes large volumes of data accumulated in business systems to evaluate performance and support decisions such as business strategy. Automating routine approval workflows is workflow systems, networked learning is e-learning, and reading competitors'' annual reports is ordinary competitive research rather than BI.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q64)',
  ARRAY[21]::int[],
  'native_text',
