  'A',
  71,
  'Q71. Which of the following is an explanation of a smart grid?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,427.74,385.41,441.19],"text":"Q71.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of a smart grid?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,446.93,516.94,478.21],"text":"a) It is a system that aims at the utilization of recyclable energy, supply of stable electric"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,482.93,505.43,550.21],"text":"power, and optimum demand adjustment through the integrated control of power\ngeneration and power consumption on the basis of communication and information-\nprocessing technology.\nb) It is a system that can provide ideal health advice to each individual by performing"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,554.93,530.49,604.21],"text":"analysis on the basis of similar case reports such as the result of health examinations and\nmedication use.\nc) It is a system that can search for information on restaurants and entertainment, send and"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,608.93,500.05,658.21],"text":"receive traffic information, and communicate the current position at the time of an\nemergency by using information-processing equipment installed in vehicles.\nd) It is a system that supports varied work styles by enabling mutual communication"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[102.12,662.93,526.34,694.21],"text":"between workers with varied working styles, such as home-based employees and senior\nworkers."},{"type":"code","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 23 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is a system that aims at the utilization of recyclable energy, supply of stable electric\n power, and optimum demand adjustment through the integrated control of power\n generation and power consumption on the basis of communication and information-processing technology."},{"label":"b","text":"It is a system that can provide ideal health advice to each individual by performing\n analysis on the basis of similar case reports such as the result of health examinations and\n medication use."},{"label":"c","text":"It is a system that can search for information on restaurants and entertainment, send and\n receive traffic information, and communicate the current position at the time of an\n emergency by using information-processing equipment installed in vehicles."},{"label":"d","text":"It is a system that supports varied work styles by enabling mutual communication\n between workers with varied working styles, such as home-based employees and senior\n workers."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'A smart grid is a power network that uses communication and information-processing technology to integrate control of power generation and consumption, enabling use of renewable energy, stable supply and demand adjustment. The other options describe health-advice systems, in-vehicle telematics and telework support.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q71)',
  ARRAY[23]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q71. Which of the following is an explanation of a smart grid?

 a) It is a system that aims at the utilization of recyclable energy, supply of stable electric
 power, and optimum demand adjustment through the integrated control of power
 generation and power consumption on the basis of communication and information-processing technology.
 b) It is a system that can provide ideal health advice to each individual by performing
 analysis on the basis of similar case reports such as the result of health examinations and
