  72,
  'Q72. Which of the following is an explanation of CAD?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,353.8,81.19],"text":"Q72.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of CAD?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,86.93,531.4,118.21],"text":"a) Evaluating product performance and functions using computers, without using the actual"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,122.93,531.31,154.21],"text":"product to perform testing or experimentation\nb) Using a computer to convert product design drawings to process design information, and"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,158.93,503.99,190.21],"text":"support automation of machine processing, etc.\nc) Using a computer to create product design drawings from attribute data concerning"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,194.93,489.35,226.21],"text":"product shape, composition, etc.\nd) Using a computer to derive the required volumes and timing of materials from a"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,230.93,449.29,279.13],"text":"production schedule, a BOM (bill of materials), inventory volumes, etc."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Evaluating product performance and functions using computers, without using the actual\n product to perform testing or experimentation"},{"label":"b","text":"Using a computer to convert product design drawings to process design information, and\n support automation of machine processing, etc."},{"label":"c","text":"Using a computer to create product design drawings from attribute data concerning\n product shape, composition, etc."},{"label":"d","text":"Using a computer to derive the required volumes and timing of materials from a\n production schedule, a BOM (bill of materials), inventory volumes, etc."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'CAD (Computer-Aided Design) uses a computer to create product design drawings from data about the product''s shape and composition. Evaluating performance by computer simulation is CAE, converting designs into machining information is CAM, and calculating material requirements from a schedule and BOM is MRP.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q72)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q72. Which of the following is an explanation of CAD?

 a) Evaluating product performance and functions using computers, without using the actual
 product to perform testing or experimentation
 b) Using a computer to convert product design drawings to process design information, and
 support automation of machine processing, etc.
 c) Using a computer to create product design drawings from attribute data concerning
 product shape, composition, etc.
 d) Using a computer to derive the required volumes and timing of materials from a
 production schedule, a BOM (bill of materials), inventory volumes, etc.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[24]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
