(
  '2023-october',
  'A',
  73,
  'Q73. Which of the following is an explanation of an e-marketplace?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,284.76,410.39,316.21],"text":"Q73.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of an e-marketplace?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,320.93,521.75,334.21],"text":"a) It is a method in which many sellers and buyers meet in a market set up on the Internet"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,338.93,518.71,370.21],"text":"and trade directly without an intermediate distributor.\nb) It is a method that aims for overall optimization from material procurement to product"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,374.93,502.72,424.21],"text":"distribution by sharing information such as ordering, inventory, sales, and logistics\nbetween a company and its business partners.\nc) It is a method that converts information concerning business transactions into a"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,428.93,506.0,478.21],"text":"standardized format and electronically exchanges data such as estimation, ordering,\nshipment and delivery, and payment between companies.\nd) It is a method that runs a sales promotion campaign on the Internet and then draws"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,482.93,407.93,514.21],"text":"customers to a real store to encourage them to make purchases."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is a method in which many sellers and buyers meet in a market set up on the Internet\n and trade directly without an intermediate distributor."},{"label":"b","text":"It is a method that aims for overall optimization from material procurement to product\n distribution by sharing information such as ordering, inventory, sales, and logistics\n between a company and its business partners."},{"label":"c","text":"It is a method that converts information concerning business transactions into a\n standardized format and electronically exchanges data such as estimation, ordering,\n shipment and delivery, and payment between companies."},{"label":"d","text":"It is a method that runs a sales promotion campaign on the Internet and then draws\n customers to a real store to encourage them to make purchases."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'An e-marketplace is an online market where many sellers and buyers meet and trade directly without intermediary distributors. Sharing order and inventory information across partners describes SCM, standardized electronic exchange of business documents describes EDI, and drawing online customers to physical stores describes O2O.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q73)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q73. Which of the following is an explanation of an e-marketplace?

 a) It is a method in which many sellers and buyers meet in a market set up on the Internet
 and trade directly without an intermediate distributor.
 b) It is a method that aims for overall optimization from material procurement to product
 distribution by sharing information such as ordering, inventory, sales, and logistics
 between a company and its business partners.
 c) It is a method that converts information concerning business transactions into a
 standardized format and electronically exchanges data such as estimation, ordering,
 shipment and delivery, and payment between companies.
 d) It is a method that runs a sales promotion campaign on the Internet and then draws
 customers to a real store to encourage them to make purchases.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[24]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2023-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
