  74,
  'Q74. Which of the following is a characteristic of an IC tag (RFID)?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,518.93,412.42,568.21],"text":"Q74.\nWhich of the following is a characteristic of an IC tag (RFID)?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,572.93,507.41,586.21],"text":"a) It handles a large amount of information. Thus it uses an external storage device for"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,590.93,490.93,622.21],"text":"storing information.\nb) It is stain-resistant, and recorded information can be read from the outside of the"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,512.32,676.21],"text":"package.\nc) It is used by inserting the tag into a dedicated magnetic reader.\nd) It uses GPS to display location information or attribute information about the current"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,680.93,146.77,712.21],"text":"location."},{"type":"code","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 24 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It handles a large amount of information. Thus it uses an external storage device for\n storing information."},{"label":"b","text":"It is stain-resistant, and recorded information can be read from the outside of the\n package."},{"label":"c","text":"It is used by inserting the tag into a dedicated magnetic reader."},{"label":"d","text":"It uses GPS to display location information or attribute information about the current\n location."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'An IC tag (RFID) stores data in a small chip with an antenna and can be read wirelessly, so it resists dirt and can be read even through packaging, without line of sight. It holds its own data in the chip rather than needing external storage, it is not read by inserting it into a magnetic reader, and it does not use GPS.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2023A, FE, Subject-A, Q74)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q74. Which of the following is a characteristic of an IC tag (RFID)?

 a) It handles a large amount of information. Thus it uses an external storage device for
 storing information.
 b) It is stain-resistant, and recorded information can be read from the outside of the
 package.
 c) It is used by inserting the tag into a dedicated magnetic reader.
