 out different strategies?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,176.76,526.09,226.21],"text":"Q76.\nWhich of the following is a method of education and training in which trainees engage\nin simulated business activities, interact with other people to develop experiences, and try\nout different strategies?"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,248.93,518.75,262.21],"text":"a) Case study\nb) Debate\nc) In-basket\nd) Roll-playing"}]'::jsonb,
