  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Role-playing (spelled roll-playing in the choices) has trainees act out simulated business situations and interact with others to gain experience and try different approaches. A case study analyzes a real or realistic situation and discusses solutions, a debate argues opposing positions, and the in-basket method has trainees process a set of documents and tasks within a time limit.',
