  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q2. Five people are sitting at a table in a restaurant. Two of them ordered coffee, and the other three ordered tea. The waiter forgets who ordered what and puts the drinks in a random order for the five persons. What is the probability that every person gets the correct drink?"}]'::jsonb,
