  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The post-order traversal is 2, 4, 8, 7, 3, 15, 18, 13, 10. Post-order visits the left subtree, then the right subtree, then the node itself: the subtree rooted at 3 gives 2, 4, 8, 7, 3, the subtree rooted at 13 gives 15, 18, 13, and the root 10 comes last. The sorted sequence in choice a is the in-order traversal, and choice c is the pre-order traversal.',
