(
  '2024-april',
  'A',
  9,
  'Q9. When an HDD has the specifications below, what is the average access time for an HDD to
 transfer 1 MB of data in ms? Here, the average access time can be calculated as the sum of
 the average seek time, controller overhead, rotational latency, and transfer time. Other
 overheads can be ignored.

 Average seek time 4 ms
 Controller overhead 1.25 ms
 Rotation speed 5,000 rpm
 Transfer rate 60 MB/s',
  '[{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[65.22,381.77,533.09,413.05],"text":"Q9.  When an HDD has the specifications below, what is the average access time for an HDD to"},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[89.34,417.77,533.21,467.05],"text":"transfer 1 MB of data in ms? Here, the average access time can be calculated as the sum of\nthe average seek time, controller overhead, rotational latency, and transfer time. Other\noverheads can be ignored."},{"type":"table","page":6,"bbox":[107.76,486.3,398.4,560.28],"rows":[["Average seek time","4 ms"],["Controller overhead","1.25 ms"],["Rotation speed","5,000 rpm"],["Transfer rate","60 MB/s"]]},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[113.16,489.17,328.67,502.45],"text":"Average seek time\n4 ms"},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[113.16,507.65,343.67,520.93],"text":"Controller overhead\n1.25 ms"},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[113.16,526.19,355.01,539.47],"text":"Rotation speed\n5,000 rpm"},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[113.16,544.67,347.39,557.95],"text":"Transfer rate\n60 MB/s"},{"type":"text","page":6,"bbox":[65.22,582.23,485.1,613.51],"text":"a) 21.93\nb) 26.67\nc) 27.92\nd) 33.92"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"21.93"},{"label":"b","text":"26.67"},{"label":"c","text":"27.92"},{"label":"d","text":"33.92"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The average access time is about 27.92 ms. At 5,000 rpm one rotation takes 60,000/5,000 = 12 ms, so the average rotational latency is half a turn, 6 ms, and transferring 1 MB at 60 MB/s takes 1/60 s ≈ 16.67 ms. Adding seek 4 ms + controller overhead 1.25 ms + 6 ms + 16.67 ms gives 27.92 ms.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'computer-architecture'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q9)',
