),
(
  '2024-april',
  'A',
  12,
  'Q12. There is a system where the operating status is continuously monitored. Which of the
 following is an appropriate sequence of work items in capacity planning that is conducted
 when a new task is applied to the system after several years of operation?

 [Work items in capacity planning]
 (i) Evaluate the proposed system configuration, assess its appropriateness, and conduct a
 review if necessary.

 (ii) Consider a proposal for the necessary system configuration based on the system
 characteristics, including factors such as the number of servers and whether parallel
 distributed processing is performed.

 (iii) Understand the performance information of the hardware or the environment inherent
 to the system based on the operating status of the system.

 (iv) Conduct a meeting with users to gather information about the new task, understand
 requirements such as the estimated number of processes, and determine the time
 required for processes.',
  '[{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,284.76,519.62,352.21],"text":"Q12.\nThere is a system where the operating status is continuously monitored. Which of the\nfollowing is an appropriate sequence of work items in capacity planning that is conducted\nwhen a new task is applied to the system after several years of operation?"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.08,375.83,522.05,407.11],"text":"[Work items in capacity planning]\n(i) Evaluate the proposed system configuration, assess its appropriateness, and conduct a"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[107.76,411.83,205.61,425.11],"text":"review if necessary."},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.08,434.81,494.48,448.09],"text":"(ii) Consider a proposal for the necessary system configuration based on the system"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[107.76,452.81,512.59,484.09],"text":"characteristics, including factors such as the number of servers and whether parallel\ndistributed processing is performed."},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.08,493.85,522.02,507.13],"text":"(iii) Understand the performance information of the hardware or the environment inherent"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[107.76,511.85,385.65,525.13],"text":"to the system based on the operating status of the system."},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.08,534.83,509.7,548.11],"text":"(iv) Conduct a meeting with users to gather information about the new task, understand"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[107.76,552.83,496.02,584.11],"text":"requirements such as the estimated number of processes, and determine the time\nrequired for processes."},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,614.93,420.47,646.21],"text":"a) (iii), (ii), (iv), (i)\n\nb) (iii), (iv), (ii), (i)\nc) (iv), (ii), (i), (iii)\n\nd) (iv), (iii), (i), (ii)"},{"type":"code","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 7 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"(iii), (ii), (iv), (i)"},{"label":"b","text":"(iii), (iv), (ii), (i)"},{"label":"c","text":"(iv), (ii), (i), (iii)"},{"label":"d","text":"(iv), (iii), (i), (ii)"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct order is (iii), (iv), (ii), (i). Capacity planning first establishes the current performance baseline from the monitored operating status, then gathers the new task''s requirements from users, then proposes a system configuration that meets them, and finally evaluates and reviews that proposal. A configuration cannot be proposed before the requirements are known, which rules out putting (ii) before (iv).',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'computer-architecture'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q12)',
  ARRAY[7]::int[],
