  15,
  'Q15. Which of the following is the appropriate explanation of ideal hashing used during a data
 search?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[65.22,446.93,533.13,495.13],"text":"Q15.\nWhich of the following is the appropriate explanation of ideal hashing used during a data\nsearch?"},{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[84.12,518.93,525.87,532.21],"text":"a) It is advanced search technology that determines the intention of a user’s search request"},{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[84.12,536.93,515.95,586.21],"text":"by adding recognition and decision functions to an object that combines data and its\nprocessing.\nb) It is data search technology that is fast and highly scalable, in which values converted"},{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[84.12,590.93,506.7,622.21],"text":"from data with a specific algorithm are used for storage addresses of the data.\nc) It is technology and techniques for searching a large volume of accumulated data to"},{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,529.91,676.21],"text":"identify trends, correlations, patterns, and other information required for management\nand marketing.\nd) It is technology created with the aim of increasing the hit ratio for keyword searches and"},{"type":"text","page":8,"bbox":[102.12,680.93,506.74,694.21],"text":"preventing omissions in searches by using a list of synonyms and equivalent words."},{"type":"code","page":8,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 8 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is advanced search technology that determines the intention of a user’s search request\n by adding recognition and decision functions to an object that combines data and its\n processing."},{"label":"b","text":"It is data search technology that is fast and highly scalable, in which values converted\n from data with a specific algorithm are used for storage addresses of the data."},{"label":"c","text":"It is technology and techniques for searching a large volume of accumulated data to\n identify trends, correlations, patterns, and other information required for management\n and marketing."},{"label":"d","text":"It is technology created with the aim of increasing the hit ratio for keyword searches and\n preventing omissions in searches by using a list of synonyms and equivalent words."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Hashing is a fast, scalable search technique in which a hash function converts a key into a value that is used directly as the storage address of the data, so a record can be found without scanning. The other choices describe intelligent agent search, data mining, and thesaurus-based keyword expansion.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'data-structures'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q15)',
  ARRAY[8]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q15. Which of the following is the appropriate explanation of ideal hashing used during a data
 search?

 a) It is advanced search technology that determines the intention of a user’s search request
 by adding recognition and decision functions to an object that combines data and its
 processing.
 b) It is data search technology that is fast and highly scalable, in which values converted
 from data with a specific algorithm are used for storage addresses of the data.
