  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The circuit is equivalent to a three-input NAND gate. The output is NOT(x·y) OR NOT z, and by De Morgan''s law NOT(x·y) + NOT z = NOT(x·y·z). A plain three-input AND gate gives the opposite output, so it is not equivalent.',
