  18,
  'Q18. Which of the following is a critical step in creating a relational database?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":9,"bbox":[65.22,680.76,461.02,711.19],"text":"Q18.\nWhich of the following is a critical step in creating a relational database?"},{"type":"text","page":9,"bbox":[84.12,734.93,509.81,766.21],"text":"a) Building a network diagram\nb) Creating entity-relationship diagrams\nc) Designing a flowchart\nd) Programming in C++"},{"type":"code","page":9,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 9 –"}]'::jsonb,
