  25,
  'Q25. Which of the following is the name of a communication standard that is used in mobile
 phone networks and has the three characteristics described below?

 (1) All communications are processed with a packet switching scheme.
 (2) It is possible to use a communication scheme called MIMO that uses multiple
 antennas.
 (3) It has been standardized in the international standardization project 3GPP (3rd
 Generation Partnership Project).',
  '[{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,528.41,100.21],"text":"Q25.\nWhich of the following is the name of a communication standard that is used in mobile\nphone networks and has the three characteristics described below?"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[100.62,123.83,498.13,155.11],"text":"(1) All communications are processed with a packet switching scheme.\n(2) It is possible to use a communication scheme called MIMO that uses multiple"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[100.62,159.83,500.32,191.11],"text":"antennas.\n(3) It has been standardized in the international standardization project 3GPP (3rd"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[85.08,195.83,279.74,227.11],"text":"Generation Partnership Project)."},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,232.91,503.77,282.19],"text":"a) LTE (Long Term Evolution)\nb) MAC (Media Access Control)\nc) MDM (Mobile Device Management)\nd) VoIP (Voice over Internet Protocol)"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"LTE (Long Term Evolution)"},{"label":"b","text":"MAC (Media Access Control)"},{"label":"c","text":"MDM (Mobile Device Management)"},{"label":"d","text":"VoIP (Voice over Internet Protocol)"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The answer is LTE (Long Term Evolution), the 3GPP mobile standard that carries all traffic, including voice, over packet switching and supports MIMO with multiple antennas. MAC is a data link sublayer, MDM is a tool for managing corporate mobile devices, and VoIP is a voice-over-IP technique rather than a mobile network standard.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'networking'),
