 antennas.
 (3) It has been standardized in the international standardization project 3GPP (3rd
 Generation Partnership Project).

 a) LTE (Long Term Evolution) b) MAC (Media Access Control)
 c) MDM (Mobile Device Management) d) VoIP (Voice over Internet Protocol)',
