 connection information of the host?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,286.91,491.48,354.19],"text":"Q26.\nWhich of the following is the network utility that is used to check detailed TCP\nconnection information of the host?"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,358.91,479.4,390.13],"text":"a) arp\nb) ipconfig\nc) netstat\nd) ping"}]'::jsonb,
