  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'netstat displays detailed TCP connection information, such as local and remote addresses, ports and connection states, along with routing and interface statistics. arp shows the IP-to-MAC address cache, ipconfig shows the interface IP configuration, and ping only tests whether a host can be reached.',
