  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The answer is a Security Operations Center (SOC), a dedicated, skilled team that continuously monitors an organization''s systems and detects, analyzes and responds to cybersecurity incidents using both tools and defined processes. A Network Operations Center (NOC) focuses on network availability and performance rather than security, and cybersecurity is the general field, not a team.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'security-threats'),
