  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'An integration test combines modules or components that have already been unit-tested and checks that the interfaces and data exchanges between them work properly. Unit tests check individual modules in isolation, while qualification and acceptance tests confirm that the whole system meets its requirements or the user''s needs.',
