 Project Progress As planned',
  '[{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,533.17,99.13],"text":"Q42.\nWhat is the Cost Performance Index (CPI) of the project under the conditions listed\nbelow?"},{"type":"table","page":17,"bbox":[114.9,119.46,440.88,211.98],"rows":[["Project Budget (BAC)","100,000 dollars"],["Project Duration","4 months"],["Elapsed Time","1 month"],["Actual Cost (AC)","20,000 dollars"],["Project Progress","As planned"]]},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[120.24,122.33,429.7,135.61],"text":"Project Budget (BAC)\n100,000 dollars"},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[120.24,140.81,399.4,154.09],"text":"Project Duration\n4 months"},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[120.24,159.35,394.73,172.63],"text":"Elapsed Time\n1 month"},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[120.24,177.83,424.09,210.67],"text":"Actual Cost (AC)\n20,000 dollars\nProject Progress\nAs planned"},{"type":"text","page":17,"bbox":[65.22,233.93,479.1,265.21],"text":"a) 0.25\nb) 0.8\nc) 1.0\nd) 1.25"}]'::jsonb,
