  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The CPI is 1.25. With progress as planned, one quarter of the 4-month project is done, so the earned value is EV = 100,000 × 1/4 = 25,000 dollars. CPI = EV ÷ AC = 25,000 ÷ 20,000 = 1.25, which means the project is under budget. 0.8 is AC ÷ EV, the inverse ratio.',
