  'Q55. Which of the following is an example of Consumer Generated Media (CGM)?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,324.65,511.05,391.93],"text":"Q55.\nWhich of the following is an example of Consumer Generated Media (CGM)?\n\na) A website of a company through which the company publishes information about its"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,396.65,525.62,427.93],"text":"management and financial status, as well as performance trends for individual investors\nb) A website of a company through which the company transmits information about the"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,432.65,499.74,463.93],"text":"characteristics and usage methods of its products to the general consumers\nc) A website of a government organization through which the organization publishes"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,468.65,481.02,499.93],"text":"information about its policies and administrative services to the general public\nd) A website such as a blog and SNS, etc. through which an individual transmits"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[102.12,504.65,515.1,535.93],"text":"information to an unspecified number of people about the evaluation of products, etc.\nthat the person has used"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A website of a company through which the company publishes information about its\n management and financial status, as well as performance trends for individual investors"},{"label":"b","text":"A website of a company through which the company transmits information about the\n characteristics and usage methods of its products to the general consumers"},{"label":"c","text":"A website of a government organization through which the organization publishes\n information about its policies and administrative services to the general public"},{"label":"d","text":"A website such as a blog and SNS, etc. through which an individual transmits\n information to an unspecified number of people about the evaluation of products, etc.\n that the person has used"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Consumer Generated Media is content created and published by individual consumers, such as blogs and social media posts in which a person shares their evaluation of products they have used. Company investor relations sites, company product information pages and government websites are all content published by organizations, not by consumers.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
