  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[22]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-april',
  'A',
  58,
  'Q58. Which of the following is part of total quality management?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[65.22,340.74,496.43,408.19],"text":"Q58.\nWhich of the following is part of total quality management?\n\na) Designing products and services that meet or exceed customers’ expectations\nb) Focusing on the appointment of staff with long-term work experience in a similar"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[84.12,412.91,527.43,444.19],"text":"environment\nc) Prioritizing central decisions rather than empowerment to ensure the quality of products"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[84.12,448.91,509.94,480.19],"text":"and services\nd) Promoting the capability of each department to work independently in a competitive"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[102.12,484.91,141.09,498.19],"text":"manner"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Designing products and services that meet or exceed customers’ expectations"},{"label":"b","text":"Focusing on the appointment of staff with long-term work experience in a similar\n environment"},{"label":"c","text":"Prioritizing central decisions rather than empowerment to ensure the quality of products\n and services"},{"label":"d","text":"Promoting the capability of each department to work independently in a competitive\n manner"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Designing products and services that meet or exceed customer expectations is part of total quality management, which is a company-wide, customer-focused approach to continuous quality improvement. TQM relies on employee empowerment and cooperation across departments, so central decision-making and competing independent departments go against it.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q58)',
  ARRAY[22]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q58. Which of the following is part of total quality management?

 a) Designing products and services that meet or exceed customers’ expectations
 b) Focusing on the appointment of staff with long-term work experience in a similar
 environment
 c) Prioritizing central decisions rather than empowerment to ensure the quality of products
 and services
 d) Promoting the capability of each department to work independently in a competitive
 manner',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[22]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-april',
  'A',
  59,
  'Q59. When a relation between the list price of a product and the demand for the product is
 defined as a linear equation, which of the following is the appropriate numerical value to be
 inserted into blank A below?

 (1) When the list price is set to $30, the demand is 0 units.
 (2) When the list price is set to $10, the demand is 60,000 units.
 (3) When the list price is set to $15, the demand is A units.',
  '[{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[65.22,538.74,533.16,588.19],"text":"Q59.\nWhen a relation between the list price of a product and the demand for the product is\ndefined as a linear equation, which of the following is the appropriate numerical value to be\ninserted into blank A below?"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[85.08,594.53,420.11,660.85],"text":"(1) When the list price is set to $30, the demand is 0 units.\n(2) When the list price is set to $10, the demand is 60,000 units.\n(3) When the list price is set to $15, the demand is\n units."},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[354.78,648.92,365.15,661.18],"text":"A"},{"type":"text","page":22,"bbox":[84.12,684.89,491.1,715.09],"text":"a) 30,000\nb) 35,000\nc) 40,000\nd) 45,000"},{"type":"code","page":22,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 22 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"30,000"},{"label":"b","text":"35,000"},{"label":"c","text":"40,000"},{"label":"d","text":"45,000"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Blank A is 45,000 units. The demand line passes through (30, 0) and (10, 60,000), so demand rises by 60,000 ÷ 20 = 3,000 units for every one-dollar drop in price. At a price of $15 the price is 15 dollars below $30, so demand is 15 × 3,000 = 45,000 units.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'finance'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q59)',
  ARRAY[22]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q59. When a relation between the list price of a product and the demand for the product is
 defined as a linear equation, which of the following is the appropriate numerical value to be
 inserted into blank A below?

 (1) When the list price is set to $30, the demand is 0 units.
 (2) When the list price is set to $10, the demand is 60,000 units.
 (3) When the list price is set to $15, the demand is A units.

 a) 30,000 b) 35,000 c) 40,000 d) 45,000',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[22]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-april',
  'A',
  60,
  'Q60. When OSS that is released under GPL is modified and distributed, which of the
 following is an appropriate action to comply with the GPL?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,492.27,118.21],"text":"Q60.\nWhen OSS that is released under GPL is modified and distributed, which of the\nfollowing is an appropriate action to comply with the GPL?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,122.76,472.03,136.21],"text":"a) A recipient who obtains the derivative work must be strictly prohibited from"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,523.67,172.21],"text":"redistributing copies.\nb) The source code of a separate application that is statically linked to the derivative work"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,527.01,208.21],"text":"does not need to be disclosed.\nc) When the software is modified and distributed, the source code of the distributed copies"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,212.93,525.62,244.21],"text":"is made availabe to the recipients.\nd) When the source code of the derivative work is disclosed, compensation such as related"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,248.93,239.76,298.21],"text":"costs cannot be demanded."},{"type":"code","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 23 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A recipient who obtains the derivative work must be strictly prohibited from\n redistributing copies."},{"label":"b","text":"The source code of a separate application that is statically linked to the derivative work\n does not need to be disclosed."},{"label":"c","text":"When the software is modified and distributed, the source code of the distributed copies\n is made availabe to the recipients."},{"label":"d","text":"When the source code of the derivative work is disclosed, compensation such as related\n costs cannot be demanded."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Under the GPL, when modified software is distributed, its source code must be made available to the recipients, and the same freedoms to use, modify and redistribute must pass on to them. Recipients cannot be prohibited from redistributing, a program statically linked to GPL code generally forms a combined work that must also be released under the GPL, and distributors may charge fees for copies or related costs.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'intellectual-property'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024S, FE, Subject-A, Q60)',
  ARRAY[23]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q60. When OSS that is released under GPL is modified and distributed, which of the
 following is an appropriate action to comply with the GPL?

 a) A recipient who obtains the derivative work must be strictly prohibited from
 redistributing copies.
 b) The source code of a separate application that is statically linked to the derivative work
 does not need to be disclosed.
 c) When the software is modified and distributed, the source code of the distributed copies
 is made availabe to the recipients.
 d) When the source code of the derivative work is disclosed, compensation such as related
 costs cannot be demanded.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[23]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
)
