  '[{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,269.93,510.14,301.21],"text":"Q2.  What is the value of the postfix expression below? Here, A, B, C, and D are operands"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[85.74,305.93,527.68,337.21],"text":"whose values are 4, 3, 5, and 6, respectively. Symbols “+”, “−”, “×”, and “÷” are arithmetic\noperators for addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division, respectively."},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[107.7,359.27,218.98,372.55],"text":"A B 2 × + D B ÷ C × −"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[84.12,395.93,479.46,409.21],"text":"a) −3\nb) 0\nc) 3\nd) 40/3"}]'::jsonb,
