  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q12. Which of the following is the approximate availability of the system comprising five devices, namely, A, B, C, D, and E as shown in the figure below? The numeric value in parentheses represents the availability of each device. The system is operational if either device connected in parallel is available."}]'::jsonb,
