  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'The availability is about 0.795. The parallel pair A and B gives 1 − (1 − 0.8)(1 − 0.7) = 1 − 0.06 = 0.94, and the pair D and E likewise gives 1 − 0.3 × 0.2 = 0.94. These are in series with C, so the system availability is 0.94 × 0.9 × 0.94 ≈ 0.795.',
