(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  13,
  'Q13. There are minor and major page faults in an Operating System (OS). Which of the
 following is an appropriate action of the OS when a major page fault occurs?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":9,"bbox":[65.22,302.76,505.12,334.21],"text":"Q13.\nThere are minor and major page faults in an Operating System (OS). Which of the\nfollowing is an appropriate action of the OS when a major page fault occurs?"},{"type":"text","page":9,"bbox":[84.12,356.93,492.49,424.21],"text":"a) Asking the user to input the instruction corresponding to the page\nb) Looking for a page in CPU cache\nc) Looking for a page in virtual memory on the hard disk\nd) Looking for the missed block corresponding to the page on the physical memory"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Asking the user to input the instruction corresponding to the page"},{"label":"b","text":"Looking for a page in CPU cache"},{"label":"c","text":"Looking for a page in virtual memory on the hard disk"},{"label":"d","text":"Looking for the missed block corresponding to the page on the physical memory"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'On a major page fault the OS must look for the page in virtual memory on the hard disk (the swap or backing store) and load it into physical memory. A minor page fault is when the page is already in physical memory but not yet mapped, so no disk access is needed; a major fault is the case that requires the slow disk I/O.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'operating-systems'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q13)',
  ARRAY[9]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q13. There are minor and major page faults in an Operating System (OS). Which of the
 following is an appropriate action of the OS when a major page fault occurs?

 a) Asking the user to input the instruction corresponding to the page
 b) Looking for a page in CPU cache
 c) Looking for a page in virtual memory on the hard disk
 d) Looking for the missed block corresponding to the page on the physical memory',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[9]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
