  21,
  'Q21. If a transaction processing program ends abnormally while updating the database, the
 database is recovered by a rollback process. In these circumstances, which of the following
 is the information that is used?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":14,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,526.16,172.21],"text":"Q21.\nIf a transaction processing program ends abnormally while updating the database, the\ndatabase is recovered by a rollback process. In these circumstances, which of the following\nis the information that is used?\n\na) Post-update information of log files\nb) Pre-update information of log files\nc) The latest backup file information\nd) The latest snapshot information"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Post-update information of log files"},{"label":"b","text":"Pre-update information of log files"},{"label":"c","text":"The latest backup file information"},{"label":"d","text":"The latest snapshot information"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Rollback uses the pre-update information (before images) in the log file. These images restore the data changed by the failed transaction to its state before the update. Post-update information (after images) is used for rollforward recovery after a media failure, together with a backup.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'databases'),
