  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Condition testing is a white box technique because test cases are designed from the program''s internal logic so that each condition in a decision evaluates to both true and false. Boundary value analysis, equivalence partitioning and orthogonal array testing are black box techniques that use only the specification of inputs and outputs.',
