  '[{"label":"a","text":"To clarify the sequence relation of activities and understand the critical path that should\n be intensively managed"},{"label":"b","text":"To hierarchically detail activities and segment them into a manageable scale"},{"label":"c","text":"To optimize the total cost when there is a trade-off between the duration and the cost of\n development"},{"label":"d","text":"To represent the schedule of an activity with a horizontal bar, and clarify the start time\n and end time of the activity as well as the progress at the present point in time"}]'::jsonb,
