  'A WBS hierarchically breaks the project work down into smaller and smaller components until they reach a manageable size (work packages). Finding the critical path uses an arrow diagram or PERT, the time-cost trade-off is crashing, and showing activities as horizontal bars over time is a Gantt chart.',
