  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q48)',
  ARRAY[21]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q48. Which of the following is the work that is performed when non-functional requirements
 are defined?

 a) Clarifying the flow of information (i.e., data) between the functions constituting business
 operations
 b) Clarifying the interface for exchanging information with other systems
 c) Creating the technical requirements for the development criteria and standards according
 to the programming language used in system development
 d) Defining the scope to be implemented as system functions',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[21]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
