(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  49,
  'Q49. Which of the following is an explanation of diversity management?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,481.74,434.46,495.19],"text":"Q49.\nWhich of the following is an explanation of diversity management?"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,518.93,508.37,532.21],"text":"a) Both labor and management to reach an agreement on working conditions and work"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,536.93,523.63,568.21],"text":"together with the aim of increasing profits\nb) For employees to harmonize between work and private life, approach their work with a"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,572.93,517.65,604.21],"text":"sense of purpose, and increase the vitality of the organization\nc) For employees to take an autonomous approach to work with the aim of achieving the"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[84.12,608.93,499.99,658.21],"text":"objectives that they set for themselves and be evaluated according to the degree of\nachievement\nd) To increase the vitality of the organization by respecting the diversity among its"},{"type":"text","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,662.93,422.86,711.13],"text":"employees in terms of aspects such as gender, age, and nationality"},{"type":"code","page":21,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 21 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Both labor and management to reach an agreement on working conditions and work\n together with the aim of increasing profits"},{"label":"b","text":"For employees to harmonize between work and private life, approach their work with a\n sense of purpose, and increase the vitality of the organization"},{"label":"c","text":"For employees to take an autonomous approach to work with the aim of achieving the\n objectives that they set for themselves and be evaluated according to the degree of\n achievement"},{"label":"d","text":"To increase the vitality of the organization by respecting the diversity among its\n employees in terms of aspects such as gender, age, and nationality"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Diversity management aims to increase organizational vitality by respecting and making use of differences among employees such as gender, age and nationality. Choice b describes work-life balance, c describes management by objectives, and a describes labor-management cooperation.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q49)',
  ARRAY[21]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q49. Which of the following is an explanation of diversity management?

 a) Both labor and management to reach an agreement on working conditions and work
 together with the aim of increasing profits
 b) For employees to harmonize between work and private life, approach their work with a
 sense of purpose, and increase the vitality of the organization
