  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,265.74,465.33,279.19],"text":"Q53.\nWhich of the following is one of the main characteristics of a blockchain?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,302.93,328.36,387.13],"text":"a) A centralized ledger on a server\nb) A client-server network\nc) A distributed ledger on a peer-to-peer network\nd) A type of cryptocurrency"}]'::jsonb,
