  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'A blockchain is a distributed ledger shared across a peer-to-peer network, in which blocks are chained together with hash values so that past records are hard to alter. There is no central server or client-server structure, and while cryptocurrencies use blockchain, a blockchain itself is not a type of cryptocurrency.',
