(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  54,
  'Q54. Which of the following is the situation where an improvement can be expected by
 installing a Material Requirements Planning (MRP) system?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,392.93,503.85,460.21],"text":"Q54.\nWhich of the following is the situation where an improvement can be expected by\ninstalling a Material Requirements Planning (MRP) system?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[91.98,464.93,533.09,478.21],"text":"a) Drawing information is managed on both electronic files and hard copies, so the history"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[91.98,482.93,533.09,514.21],"text":"of design changes cannot be accurately traced.\nb) High-mix, low-volume production is adopted, so the cost of installing production"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[91.98,518.93,533.13,550.21],"text":"equipment is increasing.\nc) Information about materials and quantities necessary for production is complicated, so"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,554.93,501.43,604.21],"text":"a miscalculation of order quantity or an interruption of production often occurs.\nd) There are too many design changes, so production efficiency does not improve."},{"type":"code","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 23 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Drawing information is managed on both electronic files and hard copies, so the history\n of design changes cannot be accurately traced."},{"label":"b","text":"High-mix, low-volume production is adopted, so the cost of installing production\n equipment is increasing."},{"label":"c","text":"Information about materials and quantities necessary for production is complicated, so\n a miscalculation of order quantity or an interruption of production often occurs."},{"label":"d","text":"There are too many design changes, so production efficiency does not improve."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'MRP calculates the materials and quantities needed, and when they are needed, from the production plan and bill of materials, so it fixes miscalculated order quantities and stoppages caused by complex material information. Managing drawing history is a PDM or CAD issue, and equipment costs or frequent design changes are not what MRP addresses.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q54)',
  ARRAY[23]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q54. Which of the following is the situation where an improvement can be expected by
 installing a Material Requirements Planning (MRP) system?

 a) Drawing information is managed on both electronic files and hard copies, so the history
 of design changes cannot be accurately traced.
 b) High-mix, low-volume production is adopted, so the cost of installing production
 equipment is increasing.
 c) Information about materials and quantities necessary for production is complicated, so
 a miscalculation of order quantity or an interruption of production often occurs.
 d) There are too many design changes, so production efficiency does not improve.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[23]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  55,
  'Q55. Which of the following is the objects that can benefit from the cell production method?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,528.86,99.13],"text":"Q55.\nWhich of the following is the objects that can benefit from the cell production method?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,104.76,474.74,136.21],"text":"a) Products that require a wide variety and flexible production\nb) Products that require division of labor by standardization, simplification, and"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,409.32,190.21],"text":"specialization\nc) Products that require mass production to increase productivity\nd) Products whose specifications do not change for a long period"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Products that require a wide variety and flexible production"},{"label":"b","text":"Products that require division of labor by standardization, simplification, and\n specialization"},{"label":"c","text":"Products that require mass production to increase productivity"},{"label":"d","text":"Products whose specifications do not change for a long period"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Cell production suits products that need a wide variety and flexible production. A small team or one worker assembles a whole product in a cell, which makes it easy to switch models in high-mix, low-volume manufacturing. Division of labor, mass production and long-unchanged specifications instead suit line (flow) production.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q55)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q55. Which of the following is the objects that can benefit from the cell production method?

 a) Products that require a wide variety and flexible production
 b) Products that require division of labor by standardization, simplification, and
 specialization
 c) Products that require mass production to increase productivity
 d) Products whose specifications do not change for a long period',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[24]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  56,
  'Q56. Which of the following is a technique that can be used to discover useful information and
 relationships from large amounts of customer and market data retained by a company?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,229.74,533.11,261.13],"text":"Q56.\nWhich of the following is a technique that can be used to discover useful information and\nrelationships from large amounts of customer and market data retained by a company?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,266.93,420.49,316.21],"text":"a) Data dictionary\nb) Data flow diagram\nc) Data mining\nd) Data warehouse"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Data dictionary"},{"label":"b","text":"Data flow diagram"},{"label":"c","text":"Data mining"},{"label":"d","text":"Data warehouse"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Data mining applies statistical and machine learning techniques to large volumes of data to discover hidden patterns, rules and relationships. A data warehouse is the integrated store of historical data that is often mined, but it is a storage system rather than a discovery technique; a data dictionary and a data flow diagram are design documentation tools.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'databases'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q56)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q56. Which of the following is a technique that can be used to discover useful information and
 relationships from large amounts of customer and market data retained by a company?

 a) Data dictionary b) Data flow diagram
 c) Data mining d) Data warehouse',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[24]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2024-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2024-october',
  'A',
  57,
  'Q57. The relationship between the value “x” of a certain factor in the manufacture of a product and the value “y” of a quality characteristic of the product is plotted in the figure below. Which of the following is an appropriate interpretation of this figure?',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q57. The relationship between the value “x” of a certain factor in the manufacture of a product and the value “y” of a quality characteristic of the product is plotted in the figure below. Which of the following is an appropriate interpretation of this figure?"}]'::jsonb,
  '["2024-october-a-q57-figure1.webp"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"In order to estimate y from x, a quadratic regression coefficient needs to be calculated."},{"label":"b","text":"The correlation coefficient between x and y is negative."},{"label":"c","text":"The correlation coefficient between x and y is positive."},{"label":"d","text":"The regression expression for estimating y from x is the same as that for estimating x\n from y."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'The scatter diagram shows y tending to decrease as x increases, so the correlation coefficient between x and y is negative. The points follow a roughly straight band, so no quadratic regression is needed. The regression line for estimating y from x is generally different from the one for estimating x from y.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2024A, FE, Subject-A, Q57)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'manual_review',
  '3.0',
