(
  '2024-october',
  'B',
  1,
  'Q1. From the answer group below, select the correct combination of answers to be inserted
 into ***A*** and ***B*** in the program. Here, the array indexes start at 1.

Bicycle ridership in a city is studied. Examination of several years of data revealed that 30%
of the people who regularly ride bicycles in a given year do not regularly ride bicycles in the
subsequent year. Additionally, 2% of the people who do not regularly ride bicycles in that
year begin to ride bicycles regularly in the subsequent year. If 5,000 people ride bicycles and
100,000 people do not ride bicycles in a given year, then the following program calculates
the number of cyclists in the subsequent year (cycling) and that of people who do not ride
bicycles in the subsequent year (noncycling):',
  '[{"type":"prompt","text":"Q1. From the answer group below, select the correct combination of answers to be inserted\n into ***A*** and ***B*** in the program. Here, the array indexes start at 1."},{"type":"context","text":"Bicycle ridership in a city is studied. Examination of several years of data revealed that 30%\nof the people who regularly ride bicycles in a given year do not regularly ride bicycles in the\nsubsequent year. Additionally, 2% of the people who do not regularly ride bicycles in that\nyear begin to ride bicycles regularly in the subsequent year. If 5,000 people ride bicycles and\n100,000 people do not ride bicycles in a given year, then the following program calculates\nthe number of cyclists in the subsequent year (cycling) and that of people who do not ride\nbicycles in the subsequent year (noncycling):"},{"type":"answer_table","columns":["A","B"],"rows":[{"label":"a","values":{"A":"P[1,1] × N[1] + P[1,2] × N[2]","B":"P[2,1] × N[1] + P[2,2] × N[2]"}},{"label":"b","values":{"A":"P[1,1] × N[1] + P[1,2] × N[2]","B":"P[2,2] × N[1] + P[2,1] × N[2]"}},{"label":"c","values":{"A":"P[1,2] × N[1] + P[1,1] × N[2]","B":"P[2,2] × N[1] + P[2,1] × N[2]"}},{"label":"d","values":{"A":"P[1,2] × N[1] + P[2,2] × N[2]","B":"P[2,1] × N[1] + P[1,2] × N[2]"}},{"label":"e","values":{"A":"P[2,1] × N[1] + P[1,2] × N[2]","B":"P[1,1] × N[1] + P[2,2] × N[2]"}},{"label":"f","values":{"A":"P[2,1] × N[1] + P[2,2] × N[2]","B":"P[1,1] × N[1] + P[1,2] × N[2]"}}]}]'::jsonb,
