 we assume that the array has two or more elements and that no duplicate elements are present
 in the array.

 [Program]
 integer []: array ← {2, 6, 9, 1, 7, 5}
 integer: i
 integer: max1 ← -∞
 integer: max2 ← -∞
 for (increase i from 1
 to the number of elements of array by 1)
 if (___A___)
 max2 ← max1
 max1 ← array[i]
 elseif (array[i] > max2)
 ___B___
 endif
 endfor
 output max2

 Answer group
