  'This is insertion sort: element i is moved left until the element before it is not larger. Inside the while loop, if A[k − 1] > A[k], the two adjacent elements are exchanged (A: swap A[k] and A[k − 1]) and the position moves one step left (B: k ← k − 1) to compare again. Using A[i] or k ← k + 1 would not follow the element as it moves left and the loop would not terminate correctly.',
