  19,
  'Q19. From the answer group below, select the correct combination of answers to be inserted
 into ***A*** and ***B*** in the description.

Company X is an investment company. Recently, one of their database servers was attacked
 by an attacker.

Mr. L, the security team leader of company X, decided to ask Ms. A, a security analyst
 working for the same company, to analyze the logs. Mr. L will extract log entries related to
 database access from the log file of the attacked database server and send the extracted log
 entries to Ms. A.

When sending access log data from Mr. L to Ms. A, the following conditions were agreed
 upon in advance:

- Mr. L must encrypt the file such that only Ms. A can view it.
 - Ms. A must confirm that the sender of the file is Mr. L.

They each have an RSA key pair and have already exchanged their public keys with each
 other. They sign, verify, encrypt, and decrypt using those keys and a previously shared
 cryptographic processing software.

This time, the log entries must be ***A*** and then ***B***.',
  '[{"type":"prompt","text":"Q19. From the answer group below, select the correct combination of answers to be inserted\n into ***A*** and ***B*** in the description."},{"type":"context","text":"Company X is an investment company. Recently, one of their database servers was attacked\n by an attacker.\n\nMr. L, the security team leader of company X, decided to ask Ms. A, a security analyst\n working for the same company, to analyze the logs. Mr. L will extract log entries related to\n database access from the log file of the attacked database server and send the extracted log\n entries to Ms. A.\n\nWhen sending access log data from Mr. L to Ms. A, the following conditions were agreed\n upon in advance:\n\n- Mr. L must encrypt the file such that only Ms. A can view it.\n - Ms. A must confirm that the sender of the file is Mr. L.\n\nThey each have an RSA key pair and have already exchanged their public keys with each\n other. They sign, verify, encrypt, and decrypt using those keys and a previously shared\n cryptographic processing software.\n\nThis time, the log entries must be ***A*** and then ***B***."},{"type":"answer_table","columns":["A","B"],"rows":[{"label":"a","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s private key"}},{"label":"b","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s public key"}},{"label":"c","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s private key"}},{"label":"d","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s public key"}},{"label":"e","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s private key"}},{"label":"f","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s public key"}},{"label":"g","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s private key"}},{"label":"h","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s public key"}}]}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"signed using Mr. L’s private key encrypted using Mr. L’s private key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s private key"}},{"label":"b","text":"signed using Mr. L’s private key encrypted using Mr. L’s public key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s public key"}},{"label":"c","text":"signed using Mr. L’s private key encrypted using Ms. A’s private key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s private key"}},{"label":"d","text":"signed using Mr. L’s private key encrypted using Ms. A’s public key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s private key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s public key"}},{"label":"e","text":"signed using Mr. L’s public key encrypted using Mr. L’s private key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s private key"}},{"label":"f","text":"signed using Mr. L’s public key encrypted using Mr. L’s public key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Mr. L’s public key"}},{"label":"g","text":"signed using Mr. L’s public key encrypted using Ms. A’s private key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s private key"}},{"label":"h","text":"signed using Mr. L’s public key encrypted using Ms. A’s public key","values":{"A":"signed using Mr. L’s public key","B":"encrypted using Ms. A’s public key"}}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'To let Ms. A confirm the sender, Mr. L signs the data with his own private key, which only he holds; Ms. A verifies it with his public key. To make the data readable only by Ms. A, it is then encrypted with Ms. A''s public key, so only her private key can decrypt it. Mr. L cannot use Ms. A''s private key because he does not have it, and anything encrypted with Mr. L''s own keys could not be kept secret to Ms. A.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'cryptography'),
  'medium',
