  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[4]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2025-april',
  'A',
  3,
  'Q3. Which of the following is the most appropriate description of machine learning in AI?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,320.93,512.48,351.19],"text":"Q3.  Which of the following is the most appropriate description of machine learning in AI?"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[84.12,376.91,528.7,390.19],"text":"a) It is a technology that enters specialized knowledge in a particular field into a computer,"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[84.12,394.91,501.99,426.19],"text":"and has the computer infer by using the knowledge entered.\nb) It is a technology that gives computers the ability to learn in the same way humans"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[84.12,430.91,517.0,462.19],"text":"naturally learn, such as finding specific patterns from memorized data.\nc) It is a technology that reproduces vital phenomena or evolutionary processes by using"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[84.12,466.91,533.01,498.19],"text":"computers and machines.\nd) It is a technology to give computers the ability to manage learning materials and learning"},{"type":"text","page":4,"bbox":[102.12,502.91,486.93,534.19],"text":"by using a web system or other information technology so that people can learn\ninteractively."},{"type":"code","page":4,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 4 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"It is a technology that enters specialized knowledge in a particular field into a computer,\n and has the computer infer by using the knowledge entered."},{"label":"b","text":"It is a technology that gives computers the ability to learn in the same way humans\n naturally learn, such as finding specific patterns from memorized data."},{"label":"c","text":"It is a technology that reproduces vital phenomena or evolutionary processes by using\n computers and machines."},{"label":"d","text":"It is a technology to give computers the ability to manage learning materials and learning\n by using a web system or other information technology so that people can learn\n interactively."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Machine learning is the technology that lets computers learn from data the way humans learn from experience, for example by finding patterns in stored data, without every rule being programmed by hand. Entering an expert''s knowledge so the computer can infer from it describes an expert system, reproducing life or evolution describes artificial life, and managing learning materials over the web describes e-learning.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'algorithms'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025S, FE, Subject-A, Q3)',
  ARRAY[4]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q3. Which of the following is the most appropriate description of machine learning in AI?

