 average time of 4 clock cycles, what is the CPU performance in MIPS?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,368.64,512.91,400.09],"text":"Q8. For a CPU with a clock frequency of 800 MHz, where one instruction is executed in an"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.62,404.75,430.71,418.03],"text":"average time of 4 clock cycles, what is the CPU performance in MIPS?"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[84.12,423.83,477.96,473.11],"text":"a) 0.2\nb) 20\nc) 200\nd) 3,200"}]'::jsonb,
