  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The CPU performance is 200 MIPS. At 800 MHz the CPU runs 800 million clock cycles per second, and with 4 cycles per instruction it executes 800 ÷ 4 = 200 million instructions per second. 3,200 would come from multiplying by 4 instead of dividing.',
