 following is an appropriate term for this register?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,477.83,494.73,508.09],"text":"Q9.  When a CPU has a special register used in push and pop instructions, which of the"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[85.62,512.75,330.94,526.03],"text":"following is an appropriate term for this register?"},{"type":"text","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,549.83,410.85,634.03],"text":"a) Instruction register\nb) Program counter\nc) Stack pointer\nd) Status register"},{"type":"code","page":7,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,311.58,807.97],"text":"– 7 –"}]'::jsonb,
