  '[{"label":"a","text":"22"},{"label":"b","text":"23"},{"label":"c","text":"24"},{"label":"d","text":"25"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The copy takes about 24 ms. A 24-bit colour pixel uses 3 bytes, so the screen holds 1024 × 768 × 3 = 2,359,296 bytes. At 10 ns per byte this takes about 23,593,000 ns ≈ 23.6 ms, which rounds to 24 ms.',
