  19,
  'Q19. Which of the following is the primary goal of conceptual database design?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":11,"bbox":[65.22,68.76,458.41,100.15],"text":"Q19. Which of the following is the primary goal of conceptual database design?"},{"type":"text","page":11,"bbox":[65.22,104.93,394.89,190.15],"text":"a) To create a physical data model of the database\nb) To define the logical structure of the database\nc) To determine the exact data types for every database attribute\nd) To implement database security measures"}]'::jsonb,
