 destination of an incoming packet?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,562.74,532.77,611.11],"text":"Q23.\nWhich of the following is the most appropriate information for a router to determine the\ndestination of an incoming packet?"},{"type":"text","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,616.91,455.13,702.19],"text":"a) Destination IP address\nb) Destination MAC address\nc) Source IP address\nd) Source MAC address"},{"type":"code","page":12,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 12 –"}]'::jsonb,
