  26,
  'Q26. An administrator of a small network is testing the new network. Which of the following
 is the correct combination of the network management tools to be inserted in the blanks
 below?

 The administrator first tests reachability of a remote host using ___A___, and determines
 the path that packets take to the destination with ___B___',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q26. An administrator of a small network is testing the new network. Which of the following\n is the correct combination of the network management tools to be inserted in the blanks\n below?\n\n The administrator first tests reachability of a remote host using ___A___, and determines\n the path that packets take to the destination with ___B___"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"A: netstat, B: ping"},{"label":"b","text":"A: netstat, B: traceroute"},{"label":"c","text":"A: ping, B: traceroute"},{"label":"d","text":"A: traceroute, B: ping"}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'The correct pair is ping then traceroute. Ping sends ICMP echo requests to check whether the remote host is reachable, and traceroute lists each router hop on the path to the destination. Netstat shows the local host''s connections and statistics, not reachability or paths.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'networking'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025S, FE, Subject-A, Q26)',
