 between different parts of software work properly?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,523.46,99.13],"text":"Q38.\nWhich of the following is an appropriate test to ensure that the interfaces and linkages\nbetween different parts of software work properly?"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,122.93,408.83,154.21],"text":"a) Functional test\nb) Integration test\nc) Performance test\nd) Unit test"}]'::jsonb,
