(
  '2025-april',
  'A',
  56,
  'Q56. A smart meter is a highly functional electricity meter with a function for communications
 and a function for the management of other devices. Which of the following is not an
 appropriate purpose for installing a smart meter?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,463.74,533.24,513.13],"text":"Q56.\nA smart meter is a highly functional electricity meter with a function for communications\nand a function for the management of other devices. Which of the following is not an\nappropriate purpose for installing a smart meter?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,518.93,520.42,550.21],"text":"a) Continuing the power supply for a fixed amount of time by functioning as an auxiliary"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,554.93,526.85,604.21],"text":"power source during a power failure\nb) Improving the efficiency of meter reading work through automatic meter reading\nc) Increasing awareness of power-saving through the visualization of the amount of power"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,608.93,494.73,640.21],"text":"consumption\nd) Restraining peak power by controlling power demand through the use of demand"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[102.12,644.93,153.12,658.21],"text":"response"},{"type":"code","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 23 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Continuing the power supply for a fixed amount of time by functioning as an auxiliary\n power source during a power failure"},{"label":"b","text":"Improving the efficiency of meter reading work through automatic meter reading"},{"label":"c","text":"Increasing awareness of power-saving through the visualization of the amount of power\n consumption"},{"label":"d","text":"Restraining peak power by controlling power demand through the use of demand\n response"}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Acting as an auxiliary power source during a power failure is not a purpose of a smart meter, because a meter measures and communicates usage and cannot store or supply electricity; that is the role of a UPS or storage battery. Automatic meter reading, visualizing consumption and supporting demand response to cut peak load are all genuine purposes.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025S, FE, Subject-A, Q56)',
  ARRAY[23]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q56. A smart meter is a highly functional electricity meter with a function for communications
 and a function for the management of other devices. Which of the following is not an
 appropriate purpose for installing a smart meter?

 a) Continuing the power supply for a fixed amount of time by functioning as an auxiliary
 power source during a power failure
 b) Improving the efficiency of meter reading work through automatic meter reading
 c) Increasing awareness of power-saving through the visualization of the amount of power
 consumption
 d) Restraining peak power by controlling power demand through the use of demand
 response',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[23]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2025-april',
  'A',
  57,
  'Q57. Which of the following is the appropriate role of a facilitator in a meeting?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,469.19,81.19],"text":"Q57.\nWhich of the following is the appropriate role of a facilitator in a meeting?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,86.93,530.65,262.15],"text":"a)\nTo act as the chairperson and control the discussions in order to work out a conclusion\nthat matches the intentions of the management\nb)\nTo encourage the meeting participants to express their opinions and organize the flow\nof discussions from a neutral and impartial position\nc)\nTo offer specialized support for meeting administration, such as adjusting the schedule,\npreparing materials, or taking minutes.\nd)\nTo provide advice only on discussions related to specific areas in which the facilitator\nspecializes, such as technical or legal fields"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"To act as the chairperson and control the discussions in order to work out a conclusion\n that matches the intentions of the management"},{"label":"b","text":"To encourage the meeting participants to express their opinions and organize the flow\n of discussions from a neutral and impartial position"},{"label":"c","text":"To offer specialized support for meeting administration, such as adjusting the schedule,\n preparing materials, or taking minutes."},{"label":"d","text":"To provide advice only on discussions related to specific areas in which the facilitator\n specializes, such as technical or legal fields"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'A facilitator stays neutral and impartial, encourages participants to express their opinions, and organizes the flow of discussion so the group reaches its own conclusions. Steering the meeting toward management''s preferred conclusion contradicts neutrality, and clerical support or advice on a specialist field are different roles.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025S, FE, Subject-A, Q57)',
  ARRAY[24]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q57. Which of the following is the appropriate role of a facilitator in a meeting?

 a) To act as the chairperson and control the discussions in order to work out a conclusion
 that matches the intentions of the management
 b) To encourage the meeting participants to express their opinions and organize the flow
 of discussions from a neutral and impartial position
 c) To offer specialized support for meeting administration, such as adjusting the schedule,
 preparing materials, or taking minutes.
 d) To provide advice only on discussions related to specific areas in which the facilitator
 specializes, such as technical or legal fields',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/questions.pdf","pages":[24]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-april/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2025-april',
  'A',
  58,
  'Q58. The figure below shows part of a cause and effect diagram (also known as a fishbone
 diagram). Which of the following is the relationship between A and B?',
  '[{"type":"text","text":"Q58. The figure below shows part of a cause and effect diagram (also known as a fishbone\n diagram). Which of the following is the relationship between A and B?"}]'::jsonb,
  '["2025-april-a-q58-figure1.webp"]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"B is an attribute of A."},{"label":"b","text":"B is the cause of A."},{"label":"c","text":"B is the means of A."},{"label":"d","text":"B is the purpose of A."}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'B is the cause of A. In a cause and effect diagram, smaller branches point into larger bones, and each arrow runs from a cause toward the effect it influences, so B, attached to the bone leading to A, is a factor that causes A. Diagrams showing means or purposes are different tools, such as a tree diagram.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-operations'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025S, FE, Subject-A, Q58)',
