mark\nwith \"For Internal Use\" to the\nwebsite’s public directory","B":"monitoring tools that alert\nadministrators to any unauthorized\naccess to the public directory"}},{"label":"i","text":"with \"For Internal Use\" to the that may be mistakenly exposed\n website’s public directory","values":{"A":"an automated tool to prevent the\nupload of files containing a watermark\nwith \"For Internal Use\" to the\nwebsite’s public directory","B":"periodic checks of the files in the\npublic directory to identify any files\nthat may be mistakenly exposed"}}]'::jsonb,
