 reference model, which of the following is a device that performs protocol conversion?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,380.76,533.18,394.21],"text":"Q25.\nBetween LAN systems that are different from the transport layer upward in the OSI basic"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[85.74,398.93,506.96,412.21],"text":"reference model, which of the following is a device that performs protocol conversion?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[84.12,434.93,490.77,448.21],"text":"a) Bridge\nb) Gateway\nc) Repeater\nd) Router"}]'::jsonb,
