  'Q26. Which of the following is an Internet standard that extends the format of email header
 fields to handle not only text messages but also audio and image files?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[65.22,488.76,533.16,502.21],"text":"Q26.\nWhich of the following is an Internet standard that extends the format of email header"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[85.74,506.93,426.69,520.21],"text":"fields to handle not only text messages but also audio and image files?"},{"type":"text","page":13,"bbox":[84.12,544.91,489.41,558.19],"text":"a) HTML\nb) MHS\nc) MIME\nd) SMTP"}]'::jsonb,
