  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'MIME (Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions) extends email header fields and body formats so that messages can carry non-text content such as audio, images and attachments. SMTP is the protocol that transfers mail but originally supports only text, HTML is a web page markup language, and MHS is an older message handling system standard.',
