  'manual_review',
  '3.0',
  'Q33. In a system with the configuration and communication services shown in the figure below,
 which of the following is the most appropriate location for the installation of a WAF as a
 countermeasure for a vulnerability in a web application? Here, the WAF has no function to
 encrypt or decrypt communications.

 PC PC PC

 Internet

 HTTPS A

 Firewall

 HTTPS B

 SSL accelerator

 HTTP C

 Web server

 Service for accessing D the database

 Database server

 a) A b) B c) C d) D',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[16]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
