 Defects with minor impact: 5,000 dollars
 (6) In the first year, only defects with major impact are corrected

 a) 64,000 b) 128,000 c) 160,000 d) 640,000',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[18]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2025-october',
  'A',
  39,
  'Q39. Which of the following is refactoring in software development activities?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,374.93,516.27,442.21],"text":"Q39.\nWhich of the following is refactoring in software development activities?\n\na) In order to improve the maintainability of a program, its internal structure is modified"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,446.93,530.04,478.21],"text":"without any change to the external specifications.\nb) In order to improve the quality of a program, two programmers cooperate to perform the"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,482.93,507.07,514.21],"text":"coding of a single program.\nc) In order to obtain feedback from users, the prototype of a program to be provided is"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[84.12,518.93,529.7,550.21],"text":"created at an early stage.\nd) In order to promptly develop a program to be operated, test cases are set in advance, and"},{"type":"text","page":18,"bbox":[102.12,554.93,232.64,568.21],"text":"the program is then coded."},{"type":"code","page":18,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 18 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"In order to improve the maintainability of a program, its internal structure is modified\n without any change to the external specifications."},{"label":"b","text":"In order to improve the quality of a program, two programmers cooperate to perform the\n coding of a single program."},{"label":"c","text":"In order to obtain feedback from users, the prototype of a program to be provided is\n created at an early stage."},{"label":"d","text":"In order to promptly develop a program to be operated, test cases are set in advance, and\n the program is then coded."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'Refactoring modifies the internal structure of a program to improve maintainability and readability without changing its external behaviour or specifications. Two programmers coding together is pair programming, building an early prototype for user feedback is prototyping, and writing test cases before code is test-driven development.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'software-development'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025A, FE, Subject-A, Q39)',
  ARRAY[18]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q39. Which of the following is refactoring in software development activities?

 a) In order to improve the maintainability of a program, its internal structure is modified
 without any change to the external specifications.
 b) In order to improve the quality of a program, two programmers cooperate to perform the
 coding of a single program.
 c) In order to obtain feedback from users, the prototype of a program to be provided is
 created at an early stage.
 d) In order to promptly develop a program to be operated, test cases are set in advance, and
 the program is then coded.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[18]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
  '2025-october',
  'A',
  40,
  'Q40. Which of the following is an appropriate explanation of comprehensive patent cross-licensing?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,530.21,81.19],"text":"Q40. Which of the following is an appropriate explanation of comprehensive patent cross-"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[85.74,85.85,137.42,99.13],"text":"licensing?"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,122.93,481.07,136.21],"text":"a) An agreement to share the necessary costs for patent registration is concluded."},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,140.93,521.59,154.21],"text":"b) The source code is published free of charge on the Internet or other places, and anyone"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[102.12,158.93,311.77,172.21],"text":"may improve and redistribute the software."},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,526.4,190.21],"text":"c) The use of patent rights is mutually licensed among companies in the specified fields of"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[102.12,194.93,218.75,208.21],"text":"technology or products."},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[84.12,212.93,468.03,226.21],"text":"d) To ensure that a company’s patent rights are not violated, the right to stop a"},{"type":"text","page":19,"bbox":[102.12,230.93,303.67,244.21],"text":"counterpart’s manufacturing is exercised."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"An agreement to share the necessary costs for patent registration is concluded."},{"label":"b","text":"The source code is published free of charge on the Internet or other places, and anyone\n may improve and redistribute the software."},{"label":"c","text":"The use of patent rights is mutually licensed among companies in the specified fields of\n technology or products."},{"label":"d","text":"To ensure that a company’s patent rights are not violated, the right to stop a\n counterpart’s manufacturing is exercised."}]'::jsonb,
  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'Comprehensive patent cross-licensing means companies mutually license the use of each other''s patents within specified fields of technology or products, so each can use the other''s inventions without infringement disputes. Publishing source code for anyone to modify and redistribute describes open source, and exercising an injunction is enforcing a patent, not licensing it.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'intellectual-property'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025A, FE, Subject-A, Q40)',
  ARRAY[19]::int[],
  'native_text',
  '3.0',
  'Q40. Which of the following is an appropriate explanation of comprehensive patent cross-licensing?

 a) An agreement to share the necessary costs for patent registration is concluded.
 b) The source code is published free of charge on the Internet or other places, and anyone
 may improve and redistribute the software.
 c) The use of patent rights is mutually licensed among companies in the specified fields of
 technology or products.
 d) To ensure that a company’s patent rights are not violated, the right to stop a
 counterpart’s manufacturing is exercised.',
  '{"question_pdf":{"filename":"questions.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/questions.pdf","pages":[19]},"answer_pdf":{"filename":"answers.pdf","storage_path":"2025-october/a/answers.pdf","pages":[1]}}'::jsonb,
  true
),
(
