  'A',
  52,
  'Q52. Which of the following is the appropriate description of process innovation?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[65.22,320.76,484.49,334.21],"text":"Q52.\nWhich of the following is the appropriate description of process innovation?"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,356.93,485.29,370.21],"text":"a) Development of an innovative new product on the basis of an original and high"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,374.93,504.47,406.21],"text":"technology\nb) Development of innovative manufacturing procedures that improve the quality of a"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,410.93,530.69,442.21],"text":"product\nc) Outsourcing manufacturing to another company that has a semiconductor manufacturing"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[84.12,446.93,527.75,478.21],"text":"process\nd) Wide adoption after passing the competition, resulting in the establishment of a de facto"},{"type":"text","page":23,"bbox":[102.12,482.93,145.8,496.21],"text":"standard"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Development of an innovative new product on the basis of an original and high\n technology"},{"label":"b","text":"Development of innovative manufacturing procedures that improve the quality of a\n product"},{"label":"c","text":"Outsourcing manufacturing to another company that has a semiconductor manufacturing\n process"},{"label":"d","text":"Wide adoption after passing the competition, resulting in the establishment of a de facto\n standard"}]'::jsonb,
  'b',
  '{"value":"b"}'::jsonb,
  'Process innovation is innovation in how products are made, such as new manufacturing procedures that improve quality or efficiency. Developing a new product from original technology is product innovation, outsourcing manufacturing is a sourcing decision, and becoming a de facto standard concerns market adoption.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
