  'c',
  '{"value":"c"}'::jsonb,
  'A, data collection, corresponds to the temperature sensor attached to the equipment, which gathers the raw data. Wireless communication in the factory is data transmission (B), the abnormal value judgment tool is data analysis (C), and the display for work instructions is data utilization (D).',
