),
(
  '2025-october',
  'A',
  56,
  'Q56. Which of the following is an example of Green IT?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,535.74,356.51,549.19],"text":"Q56.\nWhich of the following is an example of Green IT?"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,572.93,340.85,586.21],"text":"a)\nDevelopment of a powerful in-house data center"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,590.93,324.17,604.21],"text":"b)\nDevelopment of efficient in-house software"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,608.93,346.48,622.21],"text":"c)\nUsing a desktop PC instead of a thin client laptop"},{"type":"text","page":24,"bbox":[84.12,626.93,380.73,640.21],"text":"d)\nUsing web conferencing instead of traveling to meetings"},{"type":"code","page":24,"bbox":[65.22,794.63,314.58,807.97],"text":"– 24 –"}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"Development of a powerful in-house data center"},{"label":"b","text":"Development of efficient in-house software"},{"label":"c","text":"Using a desktop PC instead of a thin client laptop"},{"label":"d","text":"Using web conferencing instead of traveling to meetings"}]'::jsonb,
  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'Using web conferencing instead of traveling is an example of Green IT, because it uses IT to reduce energy consumption and CO2 emissions from transport. Green IT covers both making IT itself energy-efficient and using IT to reduce environmental impact elsewhere. Building a powerful data center or switching from a thin client to a desktop PC would typically increase energy use.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025A, FE, Subject-A, Q56)',
