(
  '2025-october',
  'A',
  57,
  'Q57. Which of the following is a major role of a CIO?',
  '[{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,67.74,344.82,81.19],"text":"Q57.\nWhich of the following is a major role of a CIO?"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,86.93,512.7,118.21],"text":"a) The CIO creates a plan to optimize the effect of investment on information resources"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,122.93,509.81,172.21],"text":"across the company to support business strategy when a computerization strategy is\nestablished.\nb) The CIO gives advice to the information system department by auditing whether the"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,176.93,513.68,208.21],"text":"information system functions properly in corporate activities.\nc) The CIO receives queries about the information system, reports on the problems, and"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[84.12,212.93,527.63,262.21],"text":"gives specific instructions to the department in charge to ensure optimal management of\nthe company-wide information system.\nd) The CIO understands the status of information system development and operation and"},{"type":"text","page":25,"bbox":[65.22,266.93,492.04,333.13],"text":"provides specific instructions on improvements to ensure that the company-wide\ninformation system functions optimally."}]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  '[{"label":"a","text":"The CIO creates a plan to optimize the effect of investment on information resources\n across the company to support business strategy when a computerization strategy is\n established."},{"label":"b","text":"The CIO gives advice to the information system department by auditing whether the\n information system functions properly in corporate activities."},{"label":"c","text":"The CIO receives queries about the information system, reports on the problems, and\n gives specific instructions to the department in charge to ensure optimal management of\n the company-wide information system."},{"label":"d","text":"The CIO understands the status of information system development and operation and\n provides specific instructions on improvements to ensure that the company-wide\n information system functions optimally."}]'::jsonb,
  'a',
  '{"value":"a"}'::jsonb,
  'The CIO''s major role is to create, as part of the computerization strategy, a plan that optimizes the effect of investment in information resources across the company in support of business strategy. Auditing the information system is a role of system auditors, and handling queries or giving specific operational instructions are tasks for the information systems department, not the executive-level CIO.',
  (SELECT id FROM subtopics WHERE slug = 'business-strategy'),
  'medium',
  0.5,
  'questions.pdf',
  '(2025A, FE, Subject-A, Q57)',
