  'd',
  '{"value":"d"}'::jsonb,
  'A is not undefined and B is x.next. The loop must keep walking while x still refers to an element, so the condition is x is not undefined; when the end of the list is reached without a match, nothing is inserted. To insert y after x, y must first take over x''s old successor (y.next ← x.next) and then x.next ← y; setting y.next to x would create a cycle.',
