A 3 × 3 normal magic square is a 3 × 3 matrix where the sum of the elements for each row,
 each column, and each diagonal is the same. The square contains the numbers 1 to 9, exactly
 as shown in the figure.

4 9 2 15
 3 5 7 15
 8 1 6 15

15 15 15 15 15
