  'A is words[j] = term and B is isContainsTerm = true. Each document corpus[i] is split into words, and the inner loop checks each word against the term, setting the flag and stopping at the first match. A document is counted in df(t) once if the flag became true, so termCount increases only when isContainsTerm = true; corpus[j] would compare whole documents, not words.',
