elopers to\nuse multi-factor-authentication to log in to\nthe repository"}},{"label":"c","values":{"A":"integrating automated secret scanning\ntools","B":"adding a rule that mandates regular\nrotation of secrets"}},{"label":"d","values":{"A":"integrating automated secret scanning\ntools","B":"requiring the web application developers\nto use multi-factor-authentication to log in\nto the repository"}},{"label":"e","values":{"A":"running antivirus full scans on\ndevelopers’ PCs","B":"adding a rule that mandates regular\nrotation of secrets"}},{"label":"f","values":{"A":"running antivirus full scans on\ndevelopers’ PCs","B":"requiring web application developers to\nuse multi-factor-authentication to log in to\nthe repository"}}]}]'::jsonb,
